{ 0x0200, { 0, 0, "Hi! I'm a talking door! Please\x01""don't kick me down!\x02""" } },
{ 0x021D, { 0, 3, "My little boy isn't here right\x01""now... I think he went to play in\x01""the graveyard... Please, leave\x01""him be.\x02""" } },
{ 0x021E, { 0, 3, "Oh, my boy is asleep right now.\x01""Please come back some other\x01""time... or not at all.\x02""" } },
{ 0x0227, { 0, 2, "\x08""Who's there? Trying to come in\x01""by the rear door?! ...Oh. It's\x01""you. Of course it's you.\x04""Such a bad man... Well, since\x01""you're here, I have some juicy\x01""gossip!\x04""The boss carpenter has a son...\x01""He's the guy who sits under the\x01""tree every night...\x04""Don't tell the boss I told you!\x01""Don't tell anyone! Please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x0229, { 0, 2, "Malon's gone to sleep! I'm goin'\x01""to sleep now, too. With the\x01""door locked. Come back again\x01""when it's light out!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1001, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Y-yahoo...? Oh! It's you,\x01""\x0F"".\x04""You're... a lot bigger than the\x01""other Kokiri, you know.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1003, { 0, 0, "I'll wait right here. Go on, go\x01""see the Great Deku Tree!\x04""...And please be nice to him.\x01""He's very old.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1006, { 0, 0, "Did the Great Deku Tree give\x01""life to everything in the\x01""forest? Even you, big guy?\x04""...No. I don't think he made you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1008, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You're not allowed to leave the\x01""forest!\x07""\x10""\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1009, { 0, 0, "The Great Deku Tree said that\x01""if a Kokiri leaves the woods, he\x01""or she will die!\x04""...You're not really a Kokiri, are\x01""you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x100A, { 0, 0, "\x1A""That meanie Mido made me cut\x01""the grass at Saria's house.\x04""He told Saria he'd do it so she\x01""would like him, but I'm the one\x01""doing all the work!\x07""\x10""\x0B""\x02""" } },
{ 0x100B, { 0, 0, "You and Saria are friends, so\x01""will you help me cut the grass?\x04""You can keep anything you find.\x01""Just... don't cut ME, OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x100F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x12""hcWow! That's great news! I...\x01""think?\x04""So now you're a true Kokiri,\x01""\x0F"". A really, really tall\x01""one.\x07""\x10""\x10""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1010, { 0, 0, "\x1A""The Great Deku Tree has\x01""summoned YOU?\x04""It's an honor to talk to the\x01""Great Deku Tree! Please don't\x01""make him sad.\x07""\x10""\x03""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1011, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh... you're leaving...\x02""" } },
{ 0x1012, { 0, 3, "\x1A""But that's OK, because we'll be\x01""friends forever... won't we?\x01""Even if you're scary?\x02""" } },
{ 0x1013, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I want you to have this\x01""Ocarina... Please take good care\x01""of it. And of yourself.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1014, { 0, 3, "When you play my Ocarina, I\x01""hope you'll think of me and\x01""come back to the forest. Not to\x01""hurt it. Just to visit.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1019, { 0, 0, "If you want to learn to fight,\x01""go to the Forest Training\x01""Center on the hill just above\x01""here.\x04""Not that you look like you need\x01""training...\x02""" } },
{ 0x101B, { 0, 0, "Hee hee! Under that mask...\x01""aren't you that huge red-haired\x01""guy everyone whispers about?\x02""" } },
{ 0x101D, { 0, 0, "Doh! That's too bad for me...\x02""" } },
{ 0x101E, { 0, 0, "Yowza! I'm gonna wear this all\x01""the time! Nobody will mess with\x01""me now!\x02""" } },
{ 0x101F, { 2, 3, "\x1A""\x12""H\x07""He only gave you 10 Rupees for\x01""this 20-Rupee mask! You lost\x01""money on that deal!\x04""Go back to the Mask Shop and\x01""pay 20 Rupees for it. The rest\x01""comes out of your own pocket,\x01""King of Thieves.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1020, { 0, 0, "My buddies really want this\x01""mask! Hee hee hee!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1021, { 0, 0, "Oh, you're OK? You didn't leave\x01""the forest after all? Shame.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1023, { 0, 0, "Saria said she's waiting at the\x01""usual spot. She's the only one\x01""who isn't scared of you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1024, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Well done... Ganondorf.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1026, { 0, 3, "No... Thou knowest full well my\x01""time is short. Thou didst see to\x01""that thyself.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1027, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Listen carefully... A wicked man\x01""of the desert cast this dreadful\x01""curse upon me...\x04""...and now that man stands\x01""before me, wearing my\x01""children's trust.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1028, { 0, 0, "If you're looking for Saria, she's\x01""in the Lost Woods, as usual.\x04""The entrance is up on the cliff\x01""overlooking the village! Don't\x01""tell me a big shot like you\x01""doesn't know that!\x04""You'll get lost, I bet. Then you'll\x01""just end up back at the\x01""entrance! Harumph!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1029, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Thou must never let the desert\x01""man in black armor lay his\x01""hands on the sacred Triforce...\x04""...is what I would tell any other\x01""child. But thou art that man.\x04""Thou didst cast the curse upon\x01""me and sap my power. Thy\x01""heart craves the Sacred Realm\x01""of legend.\x04""Because of that curse, my end\x01""is nigh. Even breaking it could\x01""not save me.\x04""I will pass away soon. I do not\x01""ask thee to grieve...\x04""I ask only that thou\x01""rememberest what thou hast\x01""destroyed here, King of the\x01""Gerudo.\x04""Thou art Hyrule's final hope... or\x01""its end. I know not which.\x02""" } },
{ 0x102B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""DLet's go to Hyrule Castle,\x01""\x0F""!! ...Wait, are you\x01""going there to do something\x01""bad?\x02""" } },
{ 0x102D, { 0, 3, "Too bad... Heh heh!\x02""" } },
{ 0x102F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hey you! \"Mr. Desert Giant!\"\x01""What's your business with the\x01""Great Deku Tree?\x04""No fairy, no Kokiri clothes, and\x01""those eyes... You're not one of\x01""us!\x07""\x10""\xD0""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1030, { 0, 0, "If you want to pass through\x01""here, you should at least equip\x01""a sword and shield!\x04""Rules are rules! Even for... uh...\x01""whatever you are! Sheesh!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1031, { 0, 0, "\x08""What?!\x04""Mido won't let you go see the\x01""Great Deku Tree? He's braver\x01""than I thought...\x07""\x10""\xC8""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1032, { 0, 0, "You can buy a shield at the\x01""shop, but there's only one\x01""sword hidden somewhere in the\x01""forest.\x04""Not that you need one. Your\x01""hands look scary enough.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1033, { 0, 0, "\x1A""If you want to see the Great\x01""Deku Tree, you should at least\x01""equip a sword and shield! I-I'm\x01""not scared of you!\x07""\x10""\xD2""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1034, { 0, 0, "I, the great Mido, will NEVER\x01""accept you as one of us!\x04""How did a giant from the\x01""desert become Saria's\x01""favorite?! Grumble... grumble...\x01""and I'm not shaking!\x02""" } },
{ 0x103C, { 0, 3, "My sister took some Rupees\x01""and went shopping at the store\x01""with the red roof. Tee hee!\x04""A green Rupee is worth one, a\x01""blue one is worth five and a\x01""red one is worth twenty.\x04""...You probably just steal them,\x01""huh?\x02""" } },
{ 0x1040, { 0, 3, "Well, if you play around with it,\x01""you'll figure it out.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1041, { 0, 0, "That's not quite Saria's Song...\x02""" } },
{ 0x1042, { 0, 0, "Mido is very upset! Did you do\x01""something to him? You did,\x01""didn't you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x1043, { 0, 0, "What? Where are you going?!\x04""To the castle? Where is the\x01""castle? Are you going to take\x01""it over?\x02""" } },
{ 0x1044, { 0, 0, "We Kokiri will die if we leave\x01""the forest!\x04""...But you're not a Kokiri. You'll\x01""be fine. Everyone else won't.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1046, { 0, 0, "\x08""Hey!! What are you doing in\x01""my house?! You're too big for\x01""my house!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1047, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x0F"", you're safe!\x07""\x10""H\x02""" } },
{ 0x1048, { 0, 0, "Saria and \x0F"" will be\x01""friends forever. She said so.\x01""Nobody else gets a say.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1049, { 0, 0, "Did something happen to the\x01""Great Deku Tree? ...You were\x01""with him last.\x02""" } },
{ 0x104A, { 0, 0, "Somehow, the air in the forest\x01""has changed. It smells like sand\x01""and burning.\x02""" } },
{ 0x104B, { 0, 0, "\x0F"", are you going to go\x01""away? Good. ...I mean, bye.\x02""" } },
{ 0x104C, { 0, 0, "If you lose your shield, will you\x01""come back? Please don't come\x01""back angry.\x02""" } },
{ 0x104E, { 0, 0, "Since the Great Deku Tree\x01""withered, more meanies have\x01""been appearing in the forest...\x04""I'm scared! ...Of them AND of\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x104F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""An evil wind is blowing from\x01""the direction of the Forest\x01""Temple.\x04""Saria left, saying, \"I have to do\x01""something about it!\"\x07""\x10""P\x02""" } },
{ 0x1050, { 0, 0, "The Forest Temple is in the\x01""Sacred Forest Meadow, on the\x01""far side of the Lost Woods.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1051, { 0, 0, "Saria went to the temple and\x01""hasn't come back... If you did\x01""something to her, I'll never\x01""forgive you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1052, { 0, 0, "Hi, mister! You can't use a Deku\x01""Shield! It's only for kids!\x01""...Please don't eat me.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1053, { 0, 0, "Where's Saria? Do you know\x01""Saria, mister? Your eyes look\x01""like you know a lot of things...\x07""\x10""T\x02""" } },
{ 0x1054, { 0, 0, "Where has Mido gone during\x01""such an emergency? Hiding from\x01""you, I bet.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1055, { 0, 0, "You walked into the forest like\x01""the monsters weren't even\x01""there, mister...\x04""Before the Great Deku Tree\x01""died, you wouldn't see things\x01""like that around here... or like\x01""you.\x07""\x10""V\x02""" } },
{ 0x1056, { 0, 0, "It's dangerous outside, so I\x01""always stay inside my house.\x01""Especially when you walk by.\x01""But I'm bored to death in here!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1057, { 0, 0, "You can only buy arrows at a\x01""shop if you have a bow. Have\x01""you got one, mister? You look\x01""like you'd rather throw people.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1058, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Have you traveled much,\x01""mister? Have you met a boy\x01""named \x0F""?\x04""Mido says the Great Deku Tree\x01""withered because that boy did\x01""something wrong to it...\x04""Only Saria defended \x0F""...\x01""until she left.\x07""\x10""Y\x02""" } },
{ 0x1059, { 0, 0, "Maybe we misunderstood... or\x01""maybe Mido was right.\x02""" } },
{ 0x105A, { 0, 0, "Haven't I seen you somewhere\x01""before, mister? In a bad dream,\x01""maybe?\x02""" } },
{ 0x105B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Mister, do you know a boy\x01""named \x0F""?\x04""He left the forest and never\x01""came back...\x07""\x10""\\\x02""" } },
{ 0x105C, { 0, 0, "I wonder if \x0F"" will ever\x01""return... I hope he doesn't look\x01""like you when he does.\x02""" } },
{ 0x105D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""It'd be awesome to be big like\x01""you, mister! Even if you're\x01""scary!\x04""I want to be big and strong\x01""and beat up the Deku Scrubs,\x01""but...\x07""\x10""^\x02""" } },
{ 0x105E, { 0, 0, "We Kokiri won't ever get bigger\x01""for the rest of our lives... What\x01""a bummer! Maybe that's a good\x01""thing, if big means mean.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1060, { 0, 0, "\x1A""What are you? Even in Kokiri\x01""clothes, a desert king can't fool\x01""me!\x07""\x10""a\x02""" } },
{ 0x1061, { 0, 0, "I promised Saria I'd never let\x01""anybody through here. Not even\x01""you. ESPECIALLY not you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1062, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hi! I'm the Deku Tree sprout!\x04""Because you and Saria broke\x01""the curse on the Forest Temple,\x01""I can grow and flourish!\x04""...The one who cursed my father\x01""is helping me grow. The forest\x01""is a strange place.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1063, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Have you seen your old\x01""friends? None of them\x01""recognized you, did they?\x04""The Kokiri never grow up! Even\x01""after seven years, they're still\x01""kids. They remember you as the\x01""scary one.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1064, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You must be wondering why you\x01""were never like the others!\x04""As you've already guessed, you\x01""are no Kokiri. You are a\x01""Gerudo... the one man born to\x01""them in a hundred years.\x04""I didn't think I'd be the one to\x01""say it to your face!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1066, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You were always bound to leave\x01""this forest... and you always\x01""knew it.\x04""You know your destiny. You've\x01""always known it.\x04""Break the curses on all of the\x01""Temples... whatever it is you\x01""mean to do with Hyrule after\x01""that.\x04""My father would have told you\x01""to bring peace. I'll just ask you\x01""to think about it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1067, { 0, 0, "\x1A""That melody?!\x04""Saria plays that song all the\x01""time! You... do you know Saria?\x04""Saria taught that song only to\x01""her friends... Since when is SHE\x01""friends with YOU?\x07""\x10""o\x02""" } },
{ 0x1068, { 0, 0, "When I see you... I don't know\x01""why, but I remember... him... the\x01""boy who was always so big and\x01""quiet...\x02""" } },
{ 0x1069, { 2, 0, "\x1A""I have you now! In this gap\x01""between dreams and reality,\x01""soon all that will remain of you\x01""is your dead body!\x04""Even the King of Evil can die\x01""here!\x02""" } },
{ 0x106A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Thank you... Because of you, I\x01""could awaken as a Sage...\x04""I am Saria, the Sage of the\x01""Forest Temple... and still your\x01""friend. Somehow.\x02""" } },
{ 0x106C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The flow of time is always\x01""cruel... It seems to move\x01""differently for everyone, but no\x01""one can change it...\x04""What doesn't change with time\x01""is a memory of younger days...\x01""even yours.\x04""To come back here, play the\x01""Minuet of Forest.\x02""" } },
{ 0x106D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x0F""... I'll see you again...\x01""Try to stay good, OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x106E, { 0, 0, "Saria hasn't come back yet... But\x01""I know she'll return someday...\x01""unless you've done something.\x02""" } },
{ 0x106F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""OK... I'll trust you. Just this\x01""once.\x07""\x10""h\x02""" } },
{ 0x1070, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh... I see...\x04""Saria won't ever come back...\x04""But I made a promise to Saria...\x04""If \x0F"" came back, I'd tell\x01""him that Saria had been waiting\x01""for him...\x04""Because Saria really... liked...\x14""\x00""\x07""\x10""q\x02""" } },
{ 0x1071, { 0, 0, "Hey, you. Big guy.\x04""If you see him somewhere,\x01""please let him know...\x07""\x10""\xD6""\x02""" } },
{ 0x1073, { 0, 0, "I still think you look like\x01""somebody I've seen before,\x01""mister. Somebody nobody\x01""wanted to play with.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1074, { 0, 0, "You're such a big, strong guy! I\x01""want to be like you someday...\x01""minus the evil part.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1075, { 0, 0, "\x0F""... I wonder if he will\x01""come back...\x02""" } },
{ 0x1076, { 0, 0, "I feel like I've known you a long\x01""time, mister... and like I should\x01""run.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1077, { 0, 0, "Now that the Deku Tree's\x01""sprout is growing in the Great\x01""Deku Tree's meadow, the forest\x04""is back to normal! No thanks\x01""to... well, OK, some thanks to\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1078, { 0, 0, "We'll all work together to\x01""protect the forest! Even from\x01""you, if we have to!\x02""" } },
{ 0x1079, { 0, 3, "Somehow, a fair wind has begun\x01""to blow recently. Strange, with\x01""you around.\x02""" } },
{ 0x107A, { 0, 3, "Since a fair wind started to\x01""blow, I'm sure \x0F"" will\x01""come back!\x02""" } },
{ 0x107B, { 0, 3, "I wonder if Saria will come\x01""back...\x02""" } },
{ 0x107C, { 0, 3, "I'm sure \x0F"" will return\x01""someday!\x02""" } },
{ 0x107D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""DGreat Deku Tree... I'm back!\x01""...And so is the man who killed\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x107E, { 2, 3, "\x1A""This evil man ceaselessly uses\x01""his vile, sorcerous powers in his\x01""search for the Sacred Realm\x01""connected to Hyrule...\x04""For in that Sacred Realm lies\x01""the Triforce, which holds the\x01""essence of the gods...\x04""...but thou knowest that already.\x01""Thou hast sought it all thy life.\x02""" } },
{ 0x108F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I always believed you'd come.\x01""Because I know you...\x04""No... You don't have to explain\x01""it to me...\x04""It is destiny that you and I\x01""can't live in the same world.\x01""Not the world you want.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1090, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I will stay here as the Forest\x01""Sage... and keep watch over\x01""you.\x04""Now, please take this\x01""Medallion... and don't make me\x01""regret it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1091, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Thou hast shown thy strength...\x01""though courage was what I\x01""sought.\x04""Still, thou hast carried out my\x01""wishes. I do not understand it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1093, { 0, 1, "\x1A""Go now to Hyrule Castle...\x04""There thou wilt surely meet the\x01""Princess of Destiny...\x04""Take this stone with thee: the\x01""stone thou didst want so much\x01""that thou didst curse me for it.\x04""Thou hast it now. I pray thou\x01""art wiser than the man who\x01""cast that curse.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1094, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I knew you'd leave the forest\x01""someday, \x0F""...\x04""Because you are different from\x01""me and my friends. You always\x01""were.\x02""" } },
{ 0x1097, { 0, 0, "Jumping is going out of style\x01""now. I'm crazy about backflips!\x01""Can you do one in all that\x01""armor?\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A0, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I surrender! Don't hurt me,\x01""Gerudo King! I'll sell you Deku\x01""Nuts! 5 pieces, 20 Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A1, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""All right! You win, your\x01""majesty! I'll sell you Deku\x01""Sticks! 1 piece, 15 Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A2, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""All right! You win! Spare me,\x01""and I'll sell you a Piece of\x01""Heart! 1 piece, 10 Rupees! Not\x01""that you have one...\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A4, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""\x08""YIKES!! I'm going home! Far\x01""from you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A5, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""Not enough Rupees! Even kings\x01""have to pay! Come back again!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A6, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""You can't have this now! Come\x01""back again! Please don't be\x01""mad!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10A8, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I've been waiting for you,\x01""\x0F""!\x04""This is the Sacred Forest\x01""Meadow, my secret place. I've\x01""never shown anyone. Not even\x01""Mido.\x04""This place will be very\x01""important for both of us\x01""someday. I can feel it.\x04""If you play the Ocarina here,\x01""you can talk with the spirits of\x01""the forest.\x07""\x10""\xA9""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10AA, { 0, 3, "\x1A""OK, try to follow along with the\x01""melody I play. Are you ready?\x01""Big hands, gentle fingers!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10AB, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Huh?! How boring! C'mon! Play\x01""along!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10AC, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x12""hcGreat! Great! You CAN be\x01""gentle!\x04""Please don't forget this song!\x01""Do you promise?\x07""\x10""\xAD""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10AD, { 0, 0, "When you want to hear my\x01""voice, play Saria's Song. You\x01""can talk with me anytime... I'll\x01""always pick up for you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10AE, { 0, 0, "Are you taking good care of my\x01""Ocarina? You'd better be!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B0, { 0, 0, "Mido might know something\x01""about where Saria is.\x04""I think Mido is sulking in one of\x01""the houses around here. Hiding\x01""from you, probably.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B4, { 0, 0, "Oh, yeah. That's it! You aren't a\x01""nice guy after all!! Get away\x01""from me, Gerudo!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B5, { 0, 0, "Saria wanted to see you... Did\x01""she find you already?\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B6, { 0, 0, "Hurry up, big guy! Before it\x01""goes bad, deliver it to that old\x01""hag...\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B7, { 0, 0, "\x1A""That guy isn't here anymore.\x04""Anybody who comes into the\x01""forest gets lost.\x04""Everybody becomes a Stalfos.\x01""Everybody, Stalfos. So he's not\x01""here anymore. Only his saw is\x01""left. Hee hee.\x07""\x10""\xB8""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10B9, { 0, 0, "Heh heh heh. Are you going to\x01""become one too? No... You'd\x01""make a scary Stalfos. Heh heh!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10BB, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You know Saria's Song! We\x01""should be friends, even if you're\x01""scary! Here, take this!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10BC, { 0, 3, "Hi! Do you think my face is\x01""kind of plain? Yours sure isn't...\x02""" } },
{ 0x10BD, { 0, 3, "Let's play again sometime! If\x01""you promise not to conquer us!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10BE, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Follow along with our song on\x01""your Ocarina. We'll lead you\x01""into it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10BF, { 0, 3, "\x1A""That was quite a nice session!\x01""You play well for a warlord.\x01""Please take this.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C0, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hoo hoo! Over here!\x04""...Ganondorf. I'll be watching you\x01""very closely. Listen to this!\x01""Hoot hoot...\x07""\x10""\xC1""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C3, { 0, 3, "\x1A""If you have courage, you'll make\x01""it through the forest just fine...\x01""though I doubt courage is what\x01""drives you.\x04""Just follow your ears and listen\x01""to the sounds coming from the\x01""forest! Hoot hoot!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C4, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hoo hoo!\x04""Did you learn an Ocarina song\x01""from Saria?\x04""That melody seems to hold\x01""some mysterious power.\x04""There may be other mysterious\x01""songs like it you can learn in\x01""Hyrule. Use them wisely... for\x01""once.\x07""\x10""\xC5""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C7, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Melodies you have learned are\x01""recorded on the Quest Status\x01""Subscreen. You should memorize\x01""those melodies.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C8, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Ohh... That bum! I don't know\x01""why he's always so mean to\x01""everyone!\x04""...What he said is true, though.\x01""You're not one of us.\x07""\x10""\xC9""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10C9, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Strange things have been\x01""happening in the forest lately...\x01""ever since you arrived.\x04""You need to be ready for\x01""anything. You'd better find a\x01""weapon!\x07""\x10""2\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CA, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""All right! You win! I'll sell you\x01""Deku Seeds! 30 pieces, 40\x01""Rupees! Please put down that\x01""fist!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CB, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I give up! Let me go, and I'll\x01""sell you a Deku Shield! It's 50\x01""Rupees! A steal, Gerudo King!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CC, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I quit! Let me go, and I'll sell\x01""you some Bombs! 5 pieces, 40\x01""Rupees! You'd love those!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CD, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""Knock it off! Leave me alone,\x01""and I'll sell you Arrows! 30\x01""pieces, 70 Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CE, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""All right! You win! Spare me,\x01""and I'll sell you a Red Potion\x01""for 40 Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10CF, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""All right! You win! Spare me,\x01""and I'll sell you a Green Potion\x01""for 40 Rupees! Your magic\x01""smells awful, by the way.\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D1, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Whaaaaaaat?!\x04""Why would he summon YOU and\x01""not the great Mido?\x04""This isn't funny... You're not\x01""even one of us!\x04""And you're not even fully\x01""equipped yet!\x04""How are you going to help the\x01""Great Deku Tree without both a\x01""sword and shield ready?\x04""What? You're right, I don't have\x01""mine either, but...\x07""\x10""0\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D2, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Eh, what's that?!\x04""Oh, you have a Deku Shield...\x04""And what's THAT?!\x04""Is that the Kokiri Sword?! In\x01""those HANDS?!\x04""GOOD GRIEF!!\x07""\x10""\xD3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D3, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Well, even with all that stuff, a\x01""brute is still a brute, huh?\x07""\x10""4\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D4, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I lost! Now I'll sell you a Deku\x01""Stick for 15 Rupees. Please\x01""don't stomp me!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D5, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I lost! Leave me alone, and I'll\x01""sell you Deku Nuts! 5 pieces,\x01""20 Rupees.\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D6, { 0, 0, "And also...\x04""I'm sorry for being mean to him.\x04""Tell him that too. ...You can tell\x01""him I wasn't scared of YOU,\x01""either.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D7, { 0, 0, "Hee hee hee! You climbed all\x01""the way up here? In that\x01""armor? You're a real man!\x07""\x10""\xD8""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10D9, { 0, 0, "What did you do to the Great\x01""Deku Tree?! Tell me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10DA, { 0, 0, "If you want to go to the Lost\x01""Woods, you'd better equip the\x01""right gear! Hee hee! Not that\x04""anything there would dare touch\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x10DC, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I surrender!\x04""To make your conquest easier, I\x01""can let you carry more Deku\x01""Sticks! It'll cost you 40\x01""Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10DD, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""I surrender!\x04""To make your conquest easier, I\x01""can let you carry more Deku\x01""Nuts! It'll cost you 40 Rupees!\x07""\x10""\xA3""\x02""" } },
{ 0x10DE, { 0, 0, "\x12""8\x82""So sorry! You can't buy that\x01""right now! Please don't hurt\x01""me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x10DF, { 0, 0, "That guy isn't here anymore.\x04""Anybody who comes into the\x01""forest gets lost.\x04""Everybody becomes a Stalfos.\x01""Everybody, Stalfos. So he's not\x01""here anymore.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2001, { 0, 0, "How is Epona doing?\x04""If you play Epona's Song on\x01""your Ocarina, she'll come to\x01""you. She trusts you... I don't\x01""know why, but she does.\x04""Come back to the ranch\x01""whenever you want to train\x01""her. Just... be gentle with her.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2002, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Epona looks great! You tamed\x01""her... She was always wild like\x01""you, I guess.\x07"" \x03""\x02""" } },
{ 0x2009, { 5, 2, "\x1A""Now, \x0F"". Play this\x01""melody in front of the altar in\x01""the Temple of Time. You must\x01""protect the Triforce!\x04""...Why am I telling YOU this?\x01""Goddesses help us all.\x02""" } },
{ 0x200A, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Wha-ha-ha-hah! Is that supposed\x01""to be a disguise, big fella?\x04""Oh?\x04""Is that a \"Kee... something...\"\x01""character mask? I hear he's real\x01""popular lately.\x04""He's my boy's favorite. That\x01""\"Kee... something...\" mask... If\x01""you don't mind...\x07"" \x0B""\x02""" } },
{ 0x200D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Mmmm... mumble... mumble...\x01""Huh? Yeah, I'm awake!\x04""What?\x04""Ah! It's you! W-welcome!\x04""That was rough! Malon yelled at\x01""me for a long time!\x04""You took care of us, so... I'm\x01""proud to give you this milk.\x01""Keep the bottle. Please. No\x01""charge, sir.\x02""" } },
{ 0x200E, { 0, 0, "The road is closed beyond this\x01""point! Can't you read the sign\x01""over there?\x04""Eh? Oh, I see. Desert folk don't\x01""read Hylian. Ha ha... hah... please\x01""don't hit me.\x02""" } },
{ 0x200F, { 0, 0, "I don't want that!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2011, { 0, 0, "Oh, it's you, sir! Thanks for all\x01""your hard work! Wah ha... ha...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2014, { 0, 3, "I am Ingo... Mr. Ingo to you. I\x01""take care of these horses.\x04""You're in my way, so sc-- ...so,\x01""uh, please take your time, kid.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2016, { 0, 0, "I wish I could go to the mask\x01""shop in town to buy a present\x01""for my kid...\x04""...sigh...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2017, { 2, 0, "Oh no... He's not breathing...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2018, { 0, 0, "\x0F""!?\x02""" } },
{ 0x2019, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x08""Arrrrgh! I lost her!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2022, { 0, 0, "Little kids can't go on the\x01""\"Heart-Pounding Gravedigging\x01""Tour\" on the sign.\x04""So I just pretend to be the\x01""gravekeeper all day.\x04""But with my cute face, I'm not\x01""heart-pounding at all. Not like\x01""you. You're VERY\x01""heart-pounding.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2024, { 0, 0, "I really do have some money,\x01""you know.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2026, { 0, 0, "With this mask, I'll be just like\x01""the gravekeeper! Here's my\x01""money!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2027, { 2, 3, "\x1A""\x12""H\x07""You sold the 30-Rupee mask to\x01""a kid for full price! And he paid\x01""you without a word. Can't\x01""imagine why.\x04""Let's go back to the mask shop\x01""to pay 30 Rupees for the mask.\x01""You can get the new mask\x01""model, too.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2028, { 0, 0, "I'm gonna dig and dig! Just like\x01""the gravekeeper!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2029, { 0, 0, "In the old days there were\x01""many wild rabbits in Hyrule. Not\x01""anymore, because of all the\x01""hunting.\x04""I want to become a rabbit...\x01""Listen to the wind with those\x01""ears, hop across the ground\x01""with those legs...\x04""...and run away from you. Even\x01""if I can only pretend.\x02""" } },
{ 0x202A, { 0, 0, "I bet with those long ears you\x01""can hear the voices... These are\x01""genuine rabbit ears from the\x01""animal of legend!\x07"" +\x02""" } },
{ 0x202C, { 0, 0, "That's not the answer I wanted\x01""to hear!\x02""" } },
{ 0x202E, { 2, 3, "\x1A""\x12""H\x07""It's a 50-Rupee mask, but he\x01""paid you a crazy amount for\x01""it--more than you can count!\x04""People pay anything to make\x01""you go away.\x04""Go back to the Mask Shop and\x01""pay back just 50 Rupees of this\x01""money.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2030, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Some people in Kakariko are\x01""spreading rumors that I cheated\x01""Talon out of the ranch, but...\x04""Don't be ridiculous! Talon was\x01""weak! I, the hard-working Ingo,\x01""poured my heart into this\x01""place!\x04""...Oh! Oh, it's YOU! M-my king!\x01""Lord Ganondorf, in person!\x04""You recognized my obvious\x01""talents and gave the ranch to\x01""me! I'll never forget it!\x04""I'm raising the finest horse in\x01""Hyrule just for you, my lord!\x04""Say, Your Majesty... would you\x01""care to ride one of my horses?\x07"" 1\x02""" } },
{ 0x2032, { 0, 0, "All right then, sc-- ...as you\x01""wish, my lord! Come back\x01""anytime!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2033, { 0, 0, "You don't have enough, my lord!\x01""...Not that I'd ever ask the King\x01""for money. But the rules, you\x01""see...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2039, { 0, 0, "Ah... Your Majesty doesn't have\x01""even 50 Rupees on him? Of\x01""course, a king doesn't carry\x04""coins! But I can't race without\x01""the stakes...\x02""" } },
{ 0x203E, { 0, 0, "Wah ha hah! I won! ...I mean,\x01""Your Majesty let me win. Very\x01""generous, sir! Come back\x01""anytime!\x02""" } },
{ 0x203F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""What? What are you doing\x01""hanging around here? You big...\x01""uh... sir.\x04""I am Ingo and I mind the ranch.\x04""I've worked here for years for\x01""that lazy bum, Talon.\x04""Today, for example, he went off\x01""for a delivery and still isn't\x01""back!\x04""So I'm doing all the work around\x01""here.\x07"" @\x02""" } },
{ 0x2040, { 0, 0, "Oh well... It's tough to be a\x01""working man. You wouldn't\x01""know. You're a king.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2042, { 0, 0, "Dad went to the castle to\x01""deliver some milk, and he hasn't\x01""come back yet... You didn't see\x01""him there, did you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x2045, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I can't believe that I, the great\x01""Ingo, am working on this dump\x01""of a ranch!\x04""The owner's so lazy, I always\x01""have to do all the work around\x01""here!\x07"" F\x02""" } },
{ 0x2046, { 0, 0, "I, the hard-working Ingo, should\x01""be in charge, not that lazy bum\x01""Talon! Someone powerful should\x01""see that. Someone like you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2049, { 0, 0, "My mother composed this song.\x01""Isn't it nice? Let's sing\x01""together... even you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x204B, { 0, 0, "\x14""\x02""Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z\x01""Z...\x02""" } },
{ 0x204C, { 0, 0, "Oh... a visitor! It's been a long\x01""time since we've had a vis--\x04""...It's you.\x04""Since you came, the people of\x01""Castle Town are gone, places\x01""are in ruins, and monsters\x01""wander everywhere.\x04""Mr. Ingo uses the ranch to win\x01""your favor...\x04""Everyone seems to be turning\x01""evil...\x04""And Dad... Mr. Ingo kicked him\x01""out of the ranch...\x04""If I disobey Mr. Ingo, he'll treat\x01""the horses so badly...\x04""So... There's nothing I can do.\x01""You've seen to that.\x02""" } },
{ 0x204D, { 0, 0, "I bet nobody is faster than I am\x01""now! But I don't know if I\x01""should be happy or sad...\x02""" } },
{ 0x204E, { 0, 0, "\x14""\x02""Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z...\x01""S-stop that song... I... I...\x01""Mumble... mumble...\x02""" } },
{ 0x204F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Take a good look at that\x01""mountain. That is Death\x01""Mountain, home of the Gorons.\x04""They hold the Spiritual Stone of\x01""Fire.\x04""...You already know that. You\x01""already asked them for it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2050, { 0, 0, "Please don't tell Mr. Ingo that I\x01""sing this song... or you. Please.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2051, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You... You know my mother's\x01""song?\x04""Everyone loved that song... My\x01""dad... Even Mr. Ingo...\x04""But since you appeared, Mr.\x01""Ingo has changed completely.\x04""I can only remember the good\x01""old days while I sing it. Also...\x07"" R\x02""" } },
{ 0x2052, { 0, 0, "\x05""AEpona really loved that song...\x01""Only I could tame that horse...\x01""Even Mr. Ingo had a hard time...\x04""...And now she's yours. I hope\x01""you're good to her.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2053, { 2, 0, "This statue's one-eyed gaze\x01""pierces into your mind... and\x01""looks away.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2054, { 2, 0, "Responding to your mask, this\x01""strange stone statue talks to\x01""you...\x04""I overheard this...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2055, { 0, 0, "I'm gonna turn over a new leaf\x01""and work real hard from now\x01""on. And never, ever serve you\x01""again.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2056, { 0, 0, "Mr. Ingo... He must have been\x01""tempted by your powers. He's\x01""not really a bad person at all...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2057, { 0, 0, "Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z... Mumble...\x01""It's not easy to be a working\x01""man...\x02""" } },
{ 0x2059, { 0, 0, "If you change your mind, come\x01""back anytime!\x02""" } },
{ 0x205D, { 0, 0, "If I give ya more for free, Ingo\x01""will get mad at me. Even for\x01""you, sir. So I'd better sell it at\x01""the normal price.\x02""" } },
{ 0x205F, { 0, 0, "Hi there... I am Ingo. I'm so\x01""honored to be allowed to work\x01""here. Truly. Please don't take it\x01""away.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2060, { 0, 1, "\x1A""You... Of all people, the\x01""princess put her trust in you.\x01""We must protect this land of\x01""Hyrule. I will be watching you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2061, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh, cute ocarina! Are you going\x01""to play this song on that\x01""ocarina? With those hands?\x02""" } },
{ 0x2062, { 0, 3, "\x1A""At the foot of Death Mountain\x01""is my village, Kakariko. That is\x01""where I was born and raised.\x04""Talk to the villagers there\x01""before you go up Death\x01""Mountain. And remember: the\x01""Sheikah never forget a face.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2063, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The song I just taught you has\x01""a mysterious power. Only the\x01""Royal Family may learn it.\x04""It will prove your connection to\x01""the Royal Family, though it pains\x01""me to give it to you.\x04""The Princess is waiting for you\x01""to return to the castle with the\x01""stones. She believes in you. I\x01""pray she is right.\x02""" } },
{ 0x2064, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x08""Hoo hoot! \x0F""... Look up\x01""here!\x04""It appears your journey is about\x01""to begin!\x04""There will be many hardships\x01""ahead... That is your fate. I hope\x01""they teach you something.\x07"" e\x02""" } },
{ 0x2065, { 0, 3, "Go straight this way and you\x01""will see Hyrule Castle.\x04""You will meet a princess there...\x01""Treat her well.\x04""If you are lost and don't know\x01""which way to go, look at the\x01""Map.\x04""The areas you have explored\x01""are shown on the Map, in the\x01""Map Subscreen.\x04""On the Map Subscreen, a\x01""flashing dot shows which way\x01""you should go next.\x07"" f\x02""" } },
{ 0x2067, { 0, 3, "\x1A""All right then, I'll see you\x01""around! I'll be keeping an eye\x01""on you! Hoot hoot hoot ho!\x02""" } },
{ 0x206B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hoooo. You're a smart one. Too\x01""smart, maybe. Good luck. Hoo\x01""hoo.\x02""" } },
{ 0x206E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x0F"", the quest ahead is\x01""yours alone! Do your best... and\x01""choose wisely! Hoo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2070, { 0, 3, "\x1A""No matter how hard it is, don't\x01""get discouraged. Or angry.\x01""Especially not angry. Ho Ho\x01""Hoo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x2072, { 0, 3, "\x1A""OK, be careful and go!\x02""" } },
{ 0x208A, { 0, 0, "Here you are! Some super fresh\x01""milk...\x04""Oh? Too baaaaad!! You don't\x01""have an empty bottle, do you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x208E, { 0, 0, "Are you approaching the fences\x01""head on? If you come at an\x01""angle, the horse won't jump!\x04""If you want to try again, mount\x01""Epona and get ready!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3002, { 0, 3, "I maaaade thissss... Trrrrade for\x01""claimmm checkkk... Gerrrrudo...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3003, { 0, 3, "I giiiive thissss to yoooou forrr\x01""a souvenirrrrr. Do not use it on\x01""Gorrrrons.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3004, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hah! You actually did it! You\x01""cleared out the cavern you\x01""sealed yourself!\x04""I don't get you, Gerudo... but a\x01""Goron pays his debts.\x04""We are NOT Sworn Brothers.\x01""Take this as payment, and\x01""never forget who earned it\x01""back for us.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3007, { 0, 3, "Oh!\x04""Oh-oh!\x04""C'mon!\x04""Come on! Come on! Come on!\x04""HOT!!\x04""What a hot beat!\x04""WHOOOOAH!\x04""YEEEEAH!\x04""YAHOOO!!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3008, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I am one of the Gorons, the\x01""stone-eating people who live on\x01""Death Mountain.\x04""Look at that huge boulder over\x01""there!\x04""It blocks the entrance to\x01""Dodongo's Cavern, which was\x01""once a very important place for\x01""us Gorons...\x04""But one day, many Dodongos\x01""suddenly appeared inside. It\x01""became a very dangerous place!\x04""And then a Gerudo in black\x01""armor used his magic to seal\x01""the entrance with that boulder...\x04""...Wait. Black armor. Red hair.\x01""YOU!\x07""0*\x02""" } },
{ 0x3009, { 0, 0, "I wish I could roll down the\x01""mountain like a rock, with a\x01""Bomb Flower and...\x04""BOOOOOOM!\x04""...right into you. Then I'd be a\x01""real man.\x02""" } },
{ 0x300B, { 0, 0, "Those plants over there are\x01""Bomb Flowers. They are \"mining\x01""plants\" that grow only on this\x01""mountain.\x04""The flower's fruit is the raw\x01""material for bombs.\x04""A non-Goron amateur should\x01""never pick it! Though I'd love\x01""to watch you try.\x04""They usually grow only in dark\x01""places, so Bomb Flowers\x01""growing out here are extremely\x01""rare.\x02""" } },
{ 0x300D, { 0, 0, "Did you see the cavern on your\x01""way here? That is Dodongo's\x01""Cavern. The one YOU sealed.\x04""The light inside is very dim, so\x01""the Bomb Flowers, a plant\x01""unique to this mountain, grow\x01""like crazy in there!\x02""" } },
{ 0x300E, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh?\x04""We don't get many visitors way\x01""up here. Especially not your\x01""kind. Where are you from?\x04""The forest? You?\x04""What's a \"forest\"?\x04""Eh?\x04""It's where a lot of \"trees\" and\x01""\"plants\" grow?\x04""Now I'm even more confused!\x01""Nothing grows around here\x01""besides the Bomb Flowers...\x04""We don't have \"seeds\" or \"nuts\"\x01""around here either.\x04""Even Deku Sticks are very\x01""scarce around here!\x07""0\"\x02""" } },
{ 0x3011, { 0, 0, "Why did you stop me? Don't\x01""stop me here!\x04""You can't stop my wild rolling!\x01""Not even you, desert dog!\x04""This wild rolling is the only way\x01""to relieve my stress! And you\x01""are a LOT of stress!\x04""Now stand in awe of my wild,\x01""wild rolling!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3013, { 0, 0, "Thank you... I guess. Let me\x01""express my mixed feelings with\x01""more wild rolling!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3014, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh... I'm so hungry...\x04""Everyone feels faint from the\x01""food shortage in this town. We\x01""are in danger of extinction!\x04""It's because we can't enter our\x01""quarry, Dodongo's Cavern...\x01""thanks to you.\x04""We Gorons live on a diet of\x01""rocks...\x04""And the most delicious,\x01""nutritious rocks around are in\x01""Dodongo's Cavern! But that\x01""seems like ancient history now...\x04""We've become such gourmets\x01""that we can't stand to eat\x01""rocks from anywhere else!\x07""0\x15""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3015, { 0, 0, "Sigh... I want to eat the top\x01""sirloin rocks from Dodongo's\x01""Cavern! Give them back!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3016, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hey!\x04""What are YOU doing out here,\x01""Gerudo?! You might fall down!\x01""...Not that I'd catch you.\x04""If you came out here for the\x01""red stone, too bad! It's not\x01""here!\x04""What? You're looking for a\x01""\"Spiritual Stone\"? You mean\x01""that delicious-looking red stone\x01""that was displayed here?\x04""I was so hungry I thought I'd\x01""give it one tiny little lick... so I\x01""snuck out here. But it was\x01""already gone!\x04""I think Big Brother took it away.\x04""He says YOU are after that red\x01""stone!\x07""0\x17""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3017, { 0, 0, "Big Brother has shut himself up\x01""in his room saying, \"I'll wait in\x01""here for the Royal Family's\x01""messenger!\"\x04""Not for you. Definitely not for\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3018, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'm so hungry I can't think about\x01""anything but food!\x04""Ask Big Brother about\x01""complicated things.\x04""If he's in a bad mood, he'll\x01""probably get mad at you. And\x01""he's ALWAYS in a bad mood\x01""when you're around. But...\x04""I know his SECRET.\x04""He may not look like the type,\x01""but Big Brother loves to dance!\x01""If he gets in a rhythm, he'll\x01""surely...\x07""0\x19""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3019, { 0, 0, "Big Brother used to always\x01""listen to the music that comes\x01""from the forest...\x04""Ah yes, the good old days,\x01""before you came... That music\x01""makes me feel nostalgic, too...\x07""0,\x02""" } },
{ 0x301A, { 0, 0, "\x1A""What the heck! YOU?!\x04""When I heard the song of the\x01""Royal Family, I expected their\x01""messenger, but... it's the Gerudo\x01""who sealed our cavern!\x04""Has Darunia, big boss of the\x01""Gorons, lost so much status\x01""that the King sends HIM to\x01""me?!\x04""Now I'm REALLY angry! Get out\x01""of my face, now!\x04""You want to know why I'm in\x01""such a bad mood?\x04""Ancient creatures have infested\x01""Dodongo's Cavern!\x04""We've had a poor harvest of\x01""our special crop, Bomb Flowers!\x04""Starvation and hunger because\x01""of the rock shortage!\x04""And it's all YOUR doing! But...\x07""0\x1B""\x02""" } },
{ 0x301B, { 0, 0, "\x08""This is a Goron problem!\x04""We don't need help from\x01""strangers, least of all you!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x301C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x08""Heeey!! What a nice tune!\x04""Just like that, my anger is...\x01""well, most of it's gone! I\x01""suddenly want to dance like\x01""crazy!\x04""I am Darunia, big boss of the\x01""Gorons! And I know exactly\x01""who you are.\x04""What?\x04""You want the Spiritual Stone of\x01""Fire too? You came back for it,\x01""after all you did?\x04""The Spiritual Stone of Fire, also\x01""known as the Goron's Ruby, is\x01""our race's hidden treasure...\x04""Hold on--I'm not giving it to you\x01""that easily.\x04""Go destroy the monsters in\x01""Dodongo's Cavern. Undo what\x01""you did and prove you're a real\x01""man.\x04""If you do it, everybody will be\x01""happy again, and I'll give you\x01""the Spiritual Stone. A Goron\x01""keeps his word, even to you.\x04""Take this too. Not as a gift. As\x01""a tool.\x04""With it on, you can pick a Bomb\x01""Flower. Don't blow up any\x01""Gorons.\x02""" } },
{ 0x301D, { 0, 0, "Destroy the monsters in\x01""Dodongo's Cavern and undo\x01""your mess! Then we'll talk\x01""about the Spiritual Stone!\x02""" } },
{ 0x301E, { 0, 0, "Heh... play that tune again\x01""sometime soon. Only the tune.\x01""Not you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x301F, { 0, 3, "No matter how many times I\x01""hear that song, it doesn't get\x01""old! Even when you play it!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3020, { 0, 3, "Well, that's not quite what I\x01""was looking for...\x04""I wanted to hear a tune... from\x01""outside the mountains...\x01""something green, natural...\x04""Not desert music. That's the\x01""kind of music I want to hear...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3021, { 0, 0, "Oh, now we can enter the\x01""cavern again. Funny, since you\x01""sealed it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3023, { 0, 3, "\x1A""It's me, Darunia! Well done... I\x01""suppose.\x04""Thanks to you, we can once\x01""again eat the delicious rocks\x01""from Dodongo's Cavern until our\x01""stomachs burst!\x04""Just don't think this makes us\x01""even.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3024, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'm so hungry that I can't think\x01""about anything but food!\x04""\"Spiritual Stone?\" The red\x01""stone that lit up our city?\x04""Big Brother Darunia took it\x01""away so YOU couldn't get it.\x01""Then he shut himself in his room\x01""and won't come out.\x04""Since then, it feels like all the\x01""lights in the city have gone\x01""out... Everyone is so\x01""depressed...\x07""0%\x02""" } },
{ 0x3025, { 0, 0, "I want you to bring fire from\x01""Big Brother's room back here.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3026, { 0, 0, "Oh, I see... We should have\x01""thrown the Bomb from the\x01""cliff... at you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3027, { 0, 0, "You... destroyed the Dodongos?\x01""You?! I don't know what to call\x01""you anymore.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3029, { 0, 0, "You know, I'm grateful to you, I\x01""guess. But I will NOT name my\x01""kid after you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x302A, { 0, 0, "If you want to hear more Goron\x01""gossip, head up to our city!\x04""Goron City is just a little way\x01""up the trail. Everyone there will\x01""be thrilled to see you. Not.\x02""" } },
{ 0x302C, { 0, 0, "When all the torches on this\x01""floor are lit, Goron City is\x01""really lively!\x02""" } },
{ 0x302E, { 0, 3, "I already told you! We're out of\x01""Bombs! Ohhh... I'm so hungry!\x01""And you know why!\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x302F, { 0, 0, "How was Big Brother? Furious, I\x01""bet.\x04""By the way, do you know the\x01""music coming from deep inside\x01""this tunnel? We all like this\x01""music!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3030, { 0, 0, "I won't let you get me! You're\x01""Ganondorf! THE Ganondorf!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3031, { 0, 0, "\x1A""How could you do this to me?!\x01""You... you're Ganondorf himself!\x04""Hear my name and tremble!\x04""I am \x0F""! Hero of the\x01""Gorons!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3032, { 0, 0, "\x1A""What?\x04""Your name is also \x0F""?\x04""...Dad named me after the\x01""stranger who saved our cavern.\x01""He never said the stranger was\x01""YOU.\x04""My dad is Darunia... You\x01""remember him. Everyone\x01""remembers you.\x04""I won't sign anything for you,\x01""and you won't sign anything for\x01""me!\x04""...But you're here, and everyone\x01""else is gone. Please... help\x01""everyone!\x04""My dad, Darunia, went to the\x01""Fire Temple. A dragon is inside!\x04""If we don't hurry, even my dad\x01""will be eaten by the dragon you\x01""brought back!!\x07""03\x02""" } },
{ 0x3035, { 0, 0, "\x1A""A long time ago an evil dragon\x01""named Volvagia lived in this\x01""mountain.\x04""That dragon was very scary! He\x01""ate Gorons!\x04""Using a huge hammer, the hero\x01""of the Gorons... BOOOM!\x04""Destroyed it just like that. It's\x01""a myth from long ago, but it's\x01""true!\x04""My dad is a descendant of the\x01""hero. He'll do it again, no\x01""matter what you've done!\x07""03\x02""" } },
{ 0x3036, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Everybody was taken to the\x01""Fire Temple...\x04""While my dad was out, your\x01""followers came and took them\x01""all away!\x04""All of them will be eaten by\x01""Volvagia!\x04""Dad says you revived Volvagia...\x04""As a warning to anyone who\x01""opposes you, you're going to\x01""feed them all to the dragon!\x04""Dad went to the Fire Temple all\x01""by himself to try to save\x01""everyone...\x04""...If you really came to undo it,\x01""then take this heat-resistant\x01""tunic, and save them! Prove\x01""Dad wrong about you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3037, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Dad told me not to let anybody\x01""follow him to the temple, but...\x04""You're the only one strong\x01""enough. I can't believe I'm\x01""saying this to you.\x04""The shop owner, who's hiding\x01""somewhere right now, might\x01""help you too.\x04""Now I'll tell you about the\x01""secret passage to the Fire\x01""Temple.\x07""08\x02""" } },
{ 0x3038, { 0, 0, "Try to move the statue inside\x01""Dad's room!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3039, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Who's there? Is that you...?\x04""GANONDORF!\x04""You've grown even bigger since\x01""last time, you monster!\x04""I'd crush you right here, but\x01""now's not the time.\x04""You've revived the evil, ancient\x01""dragon Volvagia!\x04""And you're going to feed my\x01""people to it as a warning to\x01""every race that might resist\x01""you...\x04""If that dragon escapes the\x01""mountain, all of Hyrule will\x01""become a burning wasteland.\x01""Even YOUR Hyrule!\x04""I'm going on ahead to seal the\x01""dragon myself...\x04""I don't have the legendary\x01""hammer... But I have no choice.\x04""You... If there's anything left in\x01""you of the one who cleared our\x01""cavern...\x04""...then save my people while I\x01""deal with the dragon!\x04""The prisoners' cells are in the\x01""opposite direction. Don't make\x01""me regret this!\x02""" } },
{ 0x303A, { 0, 0, "You... saved me? Ganondorf\x01""saved me? ...Here, take this\x01""before I change my mind.\x02""" } },
{ 0x303B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Ganondorf... Can't hold...\x01""anymore... I can't hold it any\x01""longer...\x04""Get out of here!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x303C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You... actually did it. You killed\x01""your own dragon.\x04""On behalf of the entire Goron\x01""race... thank you. It hurts to say\x01""it.\x04""You turned out to be a real\x01""man after all. Whatever else\x01""you are.\x02""" } },
{ 0x303E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""It is something that grows over\x01""time... a true friendship. A\x01""feeling in the heart that\x01""becomes stronger over time...\x04""Even your heart, perhaps. The\x01""passion of friendship can\x01""blossom into a righteous power,\x04""and through it you will know\x01""which way to go...\x04""This song is dedicated to the\x01""power of the heart... Listen to\x01""the Bolero of Fire...\x02""" } },
{ 0x303F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf... see you again. As a\x01""friend, I hope. Or not at all.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3041, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Everybody has come back!\x04""Dad and... you... destroyed the\x01""dragon together? You?!\x07""0B\x02""" } },
{ 0x3042, { 0, 0, "When I grow up, I want to be\x01""strong like you... but good.\x01""Good like Dad.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3043, { 0, 0, "Thank you... Ganondorf. Ugh.\x01""That's hard to say.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3044, { 0, 3, "Thank you for saving us. Please\x01""don't capture us again.\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3045, { 0, 3, "\x1A""By the way, I, the wild Darunia,\x01""turned out to be the great\x01""Sage of Fire...\x04""Isn't that funny, Ganondorf?\x01""This must be what they call\x01""destiny.\x04""Nothing has made me happier\x01""than sealing the evil here...\x01""including whatever part of it is\x01""in you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3046, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Take this. It's a Medallion\x01""holding the power of the fire\x01""spirits. And my trust. Don't\x01""waste either.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3047, { 0, 3, "Big problem! Everybody is\x01""gone! But I'll keep my business\x01""open! Even for you!\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x3048, { 0, 3, "\x1A""What a wild adventure! It'll\x01""make an incredible story...\x04""I can't believe the Dodongos\x01""suddenly appeared in such great\x01""numbers!\x04""And that big rock blocking the\x01""cave...\x04""That Gerudo thief did it. He\x01""said, \"Give me the Spiritual\x01""Stone, and only then will I open\x01""the cave for you!\"\x04""...And then the same thief\x01""cleared it out himself. I don't\x01""understand you at all.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3049, { 0, 0, "Tight fit...\x02""" } },
{ 0x304A, { 0, 0, "I'm working on something really\x01""cool right now! But I think it's\x01""going to take a while...\x07""0K\x02""" } },
{ 0x304B, { 0, 0, "If you can wait five or six\x01""years, it should be ready. OK?\x01""Try not to conquer anything in\x01""the meantime.\x02""" } },
{ 0x304C, { 0, 0, "I just completed a small\x01""weapon. How about it... Don't\x01""point it at Gorons.\x07""0O\x02""" } },
{ 0x304D, { 0, 0, "How do you like the feel of it?\x02""" } },
{ 0x304E, { 0, 0, "It looks like there's a problem\x01""with its durability... But still...\x07""0O\x02""" } },
{ 0x3050, { 0, 0, "All right. Come back again.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3051, { 0, 0, "Please... Don't... Eat me... If you\x01""eat something like me, you'll get\x01""a stomach ache!\x04""You'll be sorry, Ganondorf!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3052, { 0, 0, "Oh... Big Brother Darunia asked\x01""YOU to rescue me? Things must\x01""be desperate. I owe you, I\x01""guess.\x04""Please help Big Brother!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3053, { 0, 3, "My Brotherrrr... Opened a new\x01""storrrre... It's Medigoron's Blade\x01""Storrrrrrrre...\x04""Howeverrrrr... I am betterrrrrr\x01""at making bladessssss.\x04""Hylian carpenterrrrrs praise me\x01""forrrrrr my skillssssss. Even\x01""Gerrrudo kings come to me. I'm\x01""not lyinnnnng...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3054, { 0, 3, "\x1A""That broken knife is surely my\x01""worrrrrrrrrrk... I really want to\x01""repairrrrr it, but...\x04""Because of yesterrrrrday's\x01""errrrruption, my eyes are\x01""irrrrrrrritated...\x04""There are fine eyedrops in\x01""Zora's Domain... You will find\x01""them if you go to see\x04""Kinnnnnng Zorrrrrra... if he will\x01""even see you.\x07""0U\x02""" } },
{ 0x3056, { 0, 3, "Awww nooooo... I'm finished...\x01""My eyes arrrrrre so itchy...\x01""Owwwwww...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3058, { 0, 3, "I've been waiting forrrrr you,\x01""with tearrrrrrs in my eyes...\x01""Please say hello to Kinnng\x01""Zorrra! Politely!\x02""" } },
{ 0x305A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""AWowwwwwwwwwwwwww!!\x04""This is stimulating! It's\x01""worrrrrking grrrrreat!\x04""Now I can get back to my blade\x01""business! My worrrrrk is not\x01""verrrry consistent, so I'll give\x04""this to you so you won't\x01""forrrrrget.\x07""0\\\x02""" } },
{ 0x305C, { 0, 3, "Afterrrr a few days... Please\x01""returrrrrrn... Wait, just wait\x01""patiently... even a king can\x01""wait...\x02""" } },
{ 0x305D, { 0, 3, "Not yet... Hey you... You arrrre\x01""impatient... like all tyrrrrants...\x02""" } },
{ 0x305E, { 0, 3, "That sworrrrd is my finest\x01""worrrrk! Use it wiselyyyyy...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3062, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You've done well to come all\x01""the way up here, \x0F"". This\x01""is the summit of the sacred\x01""Death Mountain! Hoot!\x04""They say the clouds around this\x01""peak reflect the condition of\x01""Death Mountain. When they look\x01""normal, it's at peace.\x04""Climbing up here proves how\x01""determined you are! Now I\x01""want to see you make a good\x01""choice for once...\x04""The Great Fairy lives on this\x01""mountaintop, and she'll give you\x01""a new skill. She is the leader of\x01""the fairies. Be polite! Hoo!\x04""I'll perch here and wait for you.\x01""When you're ready to go back\x01""down, I can help you! Now, get\x01""going!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3063, { 0, 0, "Hoo hoot! Well, it looks like the\x01""Great Fairy's power has made\x01""you even stronger...\x04""But you still don't look like a\x01""hero who will save Hyrule. I\x01""wonder if you ever will.\x04""If you're going back down the\x01""mountain, I can lend you a wing.\x01""Grab my talons and hold on\x04""tight! Try not to crush them!\x01""Hoo hooooooot!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3064, { 0, 0, "They say a beautiful fairy lives\x01""on top of Death Mountain!\x04""Don't you want to see her? I\x01""bet she won't want to see you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3065, { 0, 0, "They say a fairy lives on top of\x01""Death Mountain.\x04""If you want to make it to the\x01""top, you'd better take a big\x01""shield with you...\x02""" } },
{ 0x3067, { 0, 0, "Did you get the red stone? Let\x01""me get one little lick!\x04""No? Booooo! You're the worst!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3068, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf! You'll keep brushing\x01""up on your skills as you travel,\x01""won't you? Hopefully on\x01""monsters, not on us.\x04""You should go see the Great\x01""Fairy on top of Death Mountain!\x01""She will power you up!\x04""Hey, everybody! Let's see him\x01""off! ...From a safe distance!\x02""" } },
{ 0x3069, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'll tell you a secret for saving\x01""me... even if you're the one who\x01""caged me!\x04""In this temple, some doors fall\x01""down when you try to open\x01""them. When one starts to fall,\x01""move!\x04""If you use a sample of the\x01""Goron \"special crop,\" you can\x01""break it...\x02""" } },
{ 0x306A, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Let me tell you a secret as a\x01""reward for releasing me!\x04""When you're on fire, you can\x01""put it out by swinging your\x01""sword or by rolling forward...\x04""Did you know that? Of course\x01""you like fire.\x02""" } },
{ 0x306B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Here's a tip for rescuing me!\x04""Somewhere in this temple, you'll\x01""meet creatures that dance as\x01""they attack. Arrows won't hurt\x01""them!\x04""You might need some of the\x01""Goron \"special crop!\" That's all I\x01""have to tell you, tyrant!\x02""" } },
{ 0x306C, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'll tell you a secret for saving\x01""me!\x04""Some switches in this temple\x01""have to be cut to activate. But\x01""the Goron \"special crop\" can do\x01""the job too.\x02""" } },
{ 0x306D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'll tell you a secret for saving\x01""me!\x04""If you find a place you can see\x01""on the map but can't reach, try\x01""playing your Ocarina!\x02""" } },
{ 0x306E, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'll tell you a secret for saving\x01""me!\x04""To get into the room where\x01""Darunia went, you have to do\x01""something about the pillar stuck\x01""in the ceiling.\x04""Find a path that leads to a\x01""room above the ceiling right\x01""away!\x02""" } },
{ 0x306F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I'll tell you a secret for saving\x01""me!\x04""A door is hidden inside the\x01""statue at the entrance to this\x01""temple.\x04""But the Goron \"special crop\"\x01""won't work on it... Don't you\x01""have anything stronger? You\x01""usually do.\x02""" } },
{ 0x3070, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Here's a secret for saving me!\x04""A wall you can destroy with the\x01""Goron \"special crop\" sounds\x01""different from a regular wall\x04""when you hit it with your\x01""sword.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4002, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x0F""! This way! Hoo hoo!\x04""I wonder what Saria is doing\x01""now? How about going back to\x01""the forest sometime? It's\x04""peaceful there. Peace suits\x01""everyone.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4003, { 0, 3, "\x1A""What are you doing? You've\x01""come a long way to get up\x01""here...\x04""You should look at the Map\x01""Subscreen sometimes.\x04""This is a beautiful lake full of\x01""pure, clear water. Please keep\x01""it that way.\x04""At the lake bottom is the\x01""Water Temple, where the water\x01""spirits are worshipped. The\x01""Zoras guard it. Hoo hoo.\x04""The Zoras come from Zora's\x01""Domain in northeast Hyrule. An\x01""aquatic race, they are longtime\x01""allies of Hyrule's Royal Family.\x04""Only those connected to the\x01""Royal Family can enter Zora's\x01""Domain... Hoo hoo!\x04""I'm on my way back to the\x01""castle. If you want to come\x01""with me, hold on to my talons!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4004, { 0, 0, "I'm on my way back to the\x01""castle. If you want to come\x01""with me, hold on to my talons!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4006, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Who are you?\x04""We are the Zoras, the proud\x01""aquatic people!\x04""You claim a connection to\x01""Hyrule's Royal Family? YOU? A\x01""Gerudo?\x04""...Well, what do you want from\x01""us? Be quick.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4007, { 0, 0, "We are good at diving! How\x01""about you, desert man? Can\x01""you even swim?\x04""If you want to be a master\x01""diver, try the diving game at\x01""the top of the waterfall!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4008, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Zora's Fountain is the source of\x01""the river. Lord Jabu-Jabu lives\x01""in the fountain.\x07""@\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x4009, { 0, 0, "Lord Jabu-Jabu is the patron\x01""deity of the Zoras. Princess\x01""Ruto prepares his meals,\x01""morning and night.\x04""...He's been sick ever since a\x01""Gerudo in black armor visited.\x01""You wouldn't know anything\x01""about that.\x02""" } },
{ 0x400A, { 0, 0, "We Zoras all serve the great\x01""King Zora. Not you. Never you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x400B, { 0, 0, "The great King Zora should be\x01""in the Royal Chamber.\x02""" } },
{ 0x400D, { 0, 0, "According to the \"Legend of\x01""Zora,\" offering a fish to Lord\x01""Jabu-Jabu will make you happy.\x01""Even you. Maybe.\x02""" } },
{ 0x400E, { 0, 0, "Oh, that's not good.\x04""Everybody who comes here\x01""should see Lord Jabu-Jabu at\x01""least once!\x04""Zora's Fountain is just beyond\x01""King Zora's throne. That's where\x01""Lord Jabu-Jabu swims. But...\x04""unless you have King Zora's\x01""permission, you can't go to\x01""Zora's Fountain. And I doubt\x01""he'll give it to you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x400F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""We haven't found Princess Ruto,\x01""even though some of us have\x01""searched as far as Lake Hylia...\x02""" } },
{ 0x4010, { 0, 0, "If you find any clues to\x01""Princess Ruto's whereabouts,\x01""show them to King Zora. And if\x01""you've harmed her...\x02""" } },
{ 0x4011, { 0, 0, "All of the water in Hyrule flows\x01""from Zora's Fountain.\x04""It flows through Zora's River\x01""and reaches Lake Hylia to the\x01""south. Don't poison it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4012, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh--I've come back to life!\x04""Was it you who saved me?\x01""YOU? The Gerudo King?\x04""It looks like you have a hard\x01""time breathing underwater.\x01""Good to know you have a\x01""weakness.\x04""Still, a Zora repays a debt.\x01""Take this tunic. With it, you\x01""won't choke underwater.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4013, { 0, 3, "Princess Ruto went to the\x01""temple of Lake Hylia and hasn't\x01""come back... I'm so worried...\x01""again!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4014, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ooh... This is... well... hmmm...\x01""Eye drops...\x04""You might say we have them,\x01""you might say we don't... We do\x01""have the ingredients.\x04""Take them to the doctor at the\x01""lake laboratory, and he can\x01""make the drops.\x04""But you must deliver them\x01""fresh...\x07""@\x15""\x02""" } },
{ 0x4016, { 0, 0, "You think they'll spoil before\x01""you get there? It's not that far\x01""if you make the connection on\x04""horseback. Surely a king has a\x01""horse.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4017, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hoot hoot!\x04""\x0F"", you look like you're\x01""getting comfortable in this role\x01""you're playing.\x04""I think Princess Zelda is waiting\x01""for you to visit her again.\x04""You already have the Goron's\x01""Ruby, don't you? I hope the\x01""Gorons gave it freely.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4018, { 0, 0, "Hello there, big fellow. I'm\x01""researching medicine made by\x01""mixing Lake Hylia's water with\x01""unusual compounds.\x04""Perhaps you've met the old lady\x01""from the potion shop... she's like\x01""a student of mine. Ho ho ho!\x04""...You won't be needing poisons,\x01""I hope.\x02""" } },
{ 0x401A, { 0, 3, "Oh, my dear, sweet Princess\x01""Ruto... Where has she gone? I'm\x01""so worried...\x02""" } },
{ 0x401B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ho, this letter! It's from\x01""Princess Ruto!!\x04""Hmmm... She's inside Lord\x01""Jabu-Jabu? That's not possible!\x04""Our guardian god, Lord\x01""Jabu-Jabu, would never eat my\x01""dear Princess Ruto!\x04""But ever since YOU came here,\x01""Ganondorf, Lord Jabu-Jabu has\x01""been green around the gills...\x04""The evidence seems clear. You\x01""will go find Ruto. You owe us\x01""that. You may pass through to\x01""the altar of Lord Jabu-Jabu.\x04""I'll keep this letter. You keep\x01""the bottle. Take it respectfully,\x01""for once!\x07""@\x1C""\x02""" } },
{ 0x401C, { 0, 3, "Find my dear Princess Ruto\x01""immediately... and undo what\x01""you have done! Zora!\x02""" } },
{ 0x401E, { 0, 3, "\x08""Ooooh Noooooo!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x401F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ohhh, I'm revived... It was YOU\x01""who saved me? Don't look so\x01""smug!\x04""I'll give you a Zora Tunic as\x01""thanks. If you have this, you\x01""can... What?!\x04""You already have one? Of\x01""course you do. You take\x01""everything.\x04""With my heartfelt thanks... how\x01""about a KISS?! What? You\x01""don't want it?! Hmph. Your\x01""loss, tyrant.\x04""If you don't want my rewards,\x01""you can listen to my troubles...\x07""@\x13""\x02""" } },
{ 0x4020, { 0, 0, "I am a Zora. Have you seen a\x01""pretty Zora girl around here? If\x01""you've hurt her, I'll never\x01""forgive you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4021, { 0, 0, "I am a Zora. Have you seen\x01""anything strange in the lake?\x01""The river carries many things\x04""into this lake! Lately, mostly\x01""sorrow.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4022, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You... You're late! What took\x01""you so long? You're useless!\x04""I was just lonely, that's all...\x01""Just a little!! Not lonely for\x01""YOU, Gerudo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4023, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x08""I was scared... A little! Just a\x01""little!! Of the fish. Not of you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4024, { 5, 2, "\x1A""\x0F""! \x0F""!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4026, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You mean the Spiritual Stone of\x01""Water, Zora's Sapphire, don't\x01""you?\x07""@'\x02""" } },
{ 0x4027, { 0, 0, "\x1A""My mother gave it to me and\x01""said I should give it only to the\x01""man who will be my husband.\x04""You might call it the Zora's\x01""Engagement Ring!\x04""...You? The King of the Gerudo?\x01""Hmph. Father will faint. Fine!\x04""I'll give you my most precious\x01""possession: Zora's Sapphire!\x01""And you're stuck with me now!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4028, { 0, 2, "Don't tell my father... he'd have\x01""you skewered.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4029, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Heeheehee... Don't be shy, big\x01""brute.\x04""I can tell what you're thinking...\x07""@'\x02""" } },
{ 0x402A, { 0, 0, "I want to buy a fish, but they\x01""are a little too expensive...\x04""I have no choice but to catch\x01""one of the fish swimming around\x01""out there.\x02""" } },
{ 0x402B, { 0, 3, "So you saved the Princess, eh?\x01""I suppose... thanks. Don't let it\x01""go to your head.\x02""" } },
{ 0x402C, { 0, 0, "Did my most precious\x01""possession help you in your\x01""quest? Heehee! You'd better\x01""not be using it for evil!\x02""" } },
{ 0x402D, { 0, 0, "You're all Princess Ruto will talk\x01""about lately! We don't\x01""understand it either.\x02""" } },
{ 0x402E, { 0, 0, "Thanks to you, Lord Jabu-Jabu\x01""is back to normal. Funny how he\x01""only got sick after you visited.\x02""" } },
{ 0x402F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""We Zoras all respect the great\x01""King Zora! He has the dignity\x01""of a king. A real king. Oh yeah,\x01""he does.\x04""The grand King Zora has a\x01""Princess named Ruto. She's an\x01""only child.\x04""She's also a wild tomboy, and\x01""she's always causing the King a\x01""lot of trouble!\x07""@\x0B""\x02""" } },
{ 0x4030, { 0, 1, "\x1A""Here it is.\x04""This medicine has no\x01""preservatives, so it won't last\x01""long at this temperature.\x04""Run as fast as you can to\x01""Death Mountain. Even in that\x01""armor, you can do it!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4031, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hoo hoo! Looks like you've\x01""gotten even bigger and\x01""stronger, \x0F""!\x04""Just ahead lies Zora's Domain.\x01""The Zoras serve Hyrule's Royal\x01""Family by protecting this water\x01""source.\x04""Their door will not open for\x01""anyone except those with some\x01""connection to the Royal Family.\x04""Let them hear the melody of\x01""the Royal Family! They won't be\x01""happy to see you. Hooo hoo\x01""hoooot!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4032, { 0, 0, "When you come back next time,\x01""don't forget to bring me a\x01""souvenir! Something you didn't\x01""steal!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4033, { 2, 0, "\x1A""You found Princess Ruto! Now\x01""King Zora will give you the\x01""Spiritual Stone of Water... Well,\x01""maybe. Probably not, to you.\x04""Huh?\x02""" } },
{ 0x4036, { 0, 3, "\x1A""We meet again... Ganondorf.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4037, { 0, 3, "\x1A""This ice is created by an evil\x01""curse... The monster in the\x01""Water Temple is its source.\x04""Unless you shut off the source,\x01""this ice will never melt.\x04""You did this, or your servants\x01""did. Now undo it. If you have\x01""the will to confront the danger\x04""and save the Zoras, I will teach\x01""you the melody that leads to\x01""the temple.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4038, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Time passes, people move... Like\x01""a river's flow, it never ends...\x04""A childish mind can turn to\x01""noble ambition... or to tyranny.\x01""The clear water's surface\x04""reflects what you have grown\x01""into...\x04""Now listen to the Serenade of\x01""Water, and reflect upon\x01""yourself. Long and hard.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4039, { 0, 3, "\x1A""If you came here to meet the\x01""Zoras, you wasted your time...\x01""This is all there is. This is what\x01""you made.\x04""With one exception, the Zoras\x01""are sealed under this thick ice\x01""sheet...\x04""I rescued the Zora princess\x01""from under the ice, but... she\x01""left for the Water Temple...\x02""" } },
{ 0x403E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh... you... If I'm right...\x04""GANONDORF?!\x04""It's me, Ruto, Princess of the\x01""Zoras! Your... fiancee.\x01""Goddesses, I actually said that.\x04""I never forgot the vows we\x01""made seven years ago. Neither,\x01""it seems, did you forget to ruin\x01""my kingdom!\x04""Zora's Domain is totally frozen!\x01""You've seen it!\x04""A young man named Sheik\x01""saved me from under the ice...\x04""But my father and the other\x01""Zoras have not... yet...\x04""I want to save them all! I want\x01""to save Zora's Domain!\x04""And you are going to help me.\x01""That is an order from the\x01""woman who will be your wife,\x01""monster or not!\x04""You will help me destroy the\x01""evil monster in the Temple,\x01""understood?!\x04""Inside the Water Temple, there\x01""are three places where you can\x01""change the water level.\x04""I'll lead the way. Keep up,\x01""Gerudo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x403F, { 0, 2, "\x1A""Ganondorf! Look out! That isn't\x01""normal water over there!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4041, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf...\x04""I would expect no less from the\x01""man I chose to be my husband.\x01""Even a man like you.\x04""Zora's Domain and its people\x01""will return to their original\x01""state. No thanks to your armies.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4043, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Did Ruto want to thank me?\x04""I see...\x04""We have to return peace to\x01""Hyrule for her sake, too. Don't\x01""we? ...Even you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4045, { 0, 3, "Ah, I see... Princess Ruto went\x01""to the Water Temple...\x02""" } },
{ 0x4046, { 0, 3, "\x1A""As a reward... I grant you my\x01""eternal love.\x04""Well, that's what I'd like to say,\x01""but I can't offer it to a man\x01""like you now.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4047, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Princess Zelda... She's alive. I\x01""can sense it. So don't get your\x01""hopes up.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4049, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I have to guard the Water\x01""Temple as the Sage of Water...\x04""And you... You're searching for\x01""Princess Zelda?\x04""Hah! You can't hide anything\x01""from me! I know what you want\x01""with her!\x02""" } },
{ 0x404A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I can tell nothing will stop you...\x01""I only pray it's justice and\x01""peace you're after. Take this\x01""Medallion... Take it respectfully!\x02""" } },
{ 0x404B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You! Who are you?! A\x01""Gerudo?! In HERE?!\x04""I am Ruto, Princess of the\x01""Zoras.\x04""What?! My father asked YOU\x01""to come here to save me?\x04""I'd never ask anyone to do such\x01""a thing! Least of all you!\x04""\"Letter in a Bottle?\" I have no\x01""idea what you're talking about!\x04""My father is worried about me?\x04""I don't care!\x04""Anyway, I can't go home right\x01""now. And you... Get out of\x01""here! Understand?!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x404F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x08""That's it! That's what I've been\x01""looking for! Throw me up there,\x01""you big lug! Onto the platform!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4051, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh my goodness! I finally\x01""found... My mother's stone...\x04""I got so upset when Lord\x01""Jabu-Jabu swallowed it...\x04""While I was feeding him, he\x01""suddenly swallowed me! He's\x01""been acting strange since you\x01""came! I dropped it inside...\x04""But now that I've found it, I\x01""don't need to be in here\x01""anymore!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4052, { 0, 3, "So, take me home, right now!\x01""Carry me, brute!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4057, { 0, 3, "\x1A""As the water rises, the evil is\x01""vanishing from the lake...\x01""Ganondorf, you did it. You undid\x01""your own evil.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4058, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I... want to believe you are\x01""going to save this world...\x01""instead of ruling it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4059, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Look at that...\x04""Together, you and Princess Ruto\x01""destroyed the evil monster!\x04""Once again the lake is filled\x01""with pure water. All is as it\x01""was here, before you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4068, { 0, 0, "Oh well... Chomp chomp...\x02""" } },
{ 0x4069, { 0, 0, "You don't have enough money. I\x01""can't sell them to you, even if\x01""you glare. Chomp chomp...\x02""" } },
{ 0x406B, { 0, 0, "Oh, too bad! We're sold out!\x01""Chomp chomp... What? Oh,\x01""these beans are not for sale!\x02""" } },
{ 0x406C, { 0, 0, "If you want to plant beans, go\x01""around and look for soft soil.\x01""Chomp chomp chomp.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4074, { 0, 0, "\x1A""You may not have noticed, but\x01""I've been watching you. You\x01""touched the bottom just now.\x04""Fantastic! I'll give this to you!\x01""...Please leave the lake after.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4075, { 0, 0, "Your diving is the best in the\x01""world. Why don't you dive to\x01""the bottom of Lake Hylia? Stay\x01""down there a while.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4076, { 0, 3, "My name is Pierre, the\x01""wandering scarecrow. I wish I\x01""could wander to look for\x04""soul-moving sounds, but I'm kind\x01""of stuck here. With you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x407E, { 0, 3, "Shucks! You don't have enough\x01""money.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4085, { 0, 3, "Passion alone won't catch you\x01""many fish. Neither will glaring.\x01""I'm serious!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4088, { 0, 3, "Hey, big man! Don't you have\x01""anything important you should\x01""be doing? Like conquering?\x04""What? Are you saying it's more\x01""fun to play here?\x04""I've seen many people ruin their\x01""lives with that attitude. Fishing's\x01""better than tyranny, I guess. I'm\x01""serious! Oh well...\x02""" } },
{ 0x408D, { 0, 3, "You want to try another lure?\x01""What are you talking about?\x01""Are you so selfish? Of course\x01""you are.\x04""Don't you know the old saying,\x01""\"A great fisherman never\x01""chooses his own lure\"?\x02""" } },
{ 0x408E, { 0, 3, "What? You want to know some\x01""fishing secrets? I can't tell you\x01""any. They are company secrets.\x01""Even for a king. Seriously!\x02""" } },
{ 0x408F, { 0, 3, "What? You want to know if I'm\x01""a good fisherman?\x04""Of course I am! I'm an old pro!\x01""Do you know what a pro is? I'm\x01""telling you the truth!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4090, { 1, 0, "\x08""Rules and Regulations 1. Don't\x01""use sinking lures. 2. Don't litter.\x01""3. Walk quietly.\x04""4. Don't cast at anyone. 5. No\x01""conquering.\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x4092, { 0, 3, "Come back when you get older!\x01""The fish will be bigger, too...\x01""Well, maybe.\x02""" } },
{ 0x4094, { 0, 3, "What?\x04""You want to go fishing in a\x01""different pond?! What are you\x01""talking about?\x04""I'll go out of business if you go\x01""somewhere else! Please don't\x01""take over another pond! I'm\x01""serious!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4095, { 0, 3, "What?\x04""You want to know why I'm\x01""scratching all the time? What\x01""are you talking about?\x04""Actually, I have no idea. Nerves,\x01""maybe. You're very large. I'm\x01""serious!\x02""" } },
{ 0x4096, { 0, 3, "What?\x04""Are you trying to tell me you\x01""can't see the fish because the\x01""water is cloudy?\x04""What are you talking about?\x01""This time of day makes for\x01""fishing at its finest!\x04""You can hook a fish out of the\x01""blue, when you least expect it.\x01""Now that's exciting!\x04""I'm serious. Really, I am!\x02""" } },
{ 0x409D, { 1, 0, "\x08""Rules and Regulations 1. Don't\x01""use sinking lures. 2. Don't litter.\x01""3. Walk quietly.\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x409E, { 0, 0, "Hey! Hey! You can't take the\x01""rod out of here! Not even you!\x04""When you quit fishing, return\x01""the rod to the counter. I'm\x01""serious!\x02""" } },
{ 0x40A1, { 0, 3, "I am Bonooru, the scarecrow\x01""musical genius! I hear a song\x01""once, and I never forget it,\x04""baby! Even your evil little\x01""tunes!\x02""" } },
{ 0x40A2, { 0, 3, "Play the usual tune to call\x01""Pierre! If he's nearby, he'll come\x01""out to help you, baby!\x02""" } },
{ 0x40AD, { 0, 3, "Oh well, I don't remember that\x01""song, baby. Why? That's what I\x01""can't tell ya! Good golly!\x02""" } },
{ 0x40AF, { 0, 0, "What? Do you want to fish with\x01""a different lure? ...Hey, what's\x01""that?\x04""What? You just picked it up?\x01""Usually, the rules say you can't\x01""use one of those. But I'm not\x04""about to argue with you. What\x01""the heck...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5000, { 0, 0, "\x08""GYAAAH! You killed me!! Huh?\x01""Oh, it's you. Of course it's you.\x04""Did you try to play the Sun's\x01""Song?\x04""As I told you, with that song\x01""you can turn day to night or\x01""night to day whenever you\x01""want.\x04""When you're in darkness, it\x01""brings the sun's light to you.\x01""Even someone as dark as you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5001, { 2, 1, "\x08""When I dug a hole, I found a\x01""treasure that stretches--BOING!\x01""and shrinks--BOING! It's so fun,\x04""I'll never give it to anybody!\x01""Least of all a Gerudo!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x500D, { 0, 3, "If you change your mind, come\x01""back and visit me... Hee hee\x01""hee!\x02""" } },
{ 0x500E, { 0, 0, "You don't have enough Rupees!\x01""Hee hee hee! Even tyrants pay!\x02""" } },
{ 0x500F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""GYAAAAH! YOU KILLED ME...\x01""Unbelievable!\x04""...YOU! Ganondorf!\x04""We died so you would never\x01""have this! And now you stand\x01""in our tomb!\x04""...Calm, brother, calm. Let me\x01""introduce myself. Ahem...\x07""P\x10""\x02""" } },
{ 0x5010, { 0, 0, "I am one of the ghostly\x01""composer brothers of Kakariko\x01""Village.\x04""All the people of this village\x01""are born to serve the Royal\x01""Family of Hyrule.\x04""We brothers served the Royal\x01""Family too, assigned to study\x01""its hereditary mystic powers.\x04""We never could figure out the\x01""power of the Triforce,\x04""but we had almost completed\x01""our study of controlling time\x01""with the tones of ocarinas.\x04""Uh, I mean...\x04""Actually, we DID complete it!\x04""We would have been famous, if\x01""YOU had not tried to steal our\x01""results.\x04""We could never let you reap\x01""the fruits of our research!\x04""That's why we gave our lives to\x01""protect the secret. From you.\x07""P\x11""\x02""" } },
{ 0x5012, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x08""GYAAAAH! I'M DEAD AGAIN!\x01""What? You again?\x04""Somehow, you carry the scent\x01""of... Princess Zelda...\x04""Hmm... If the Royal Family truly\x01""trusts you, I will tell you a little\x01""more of our tale. Against my\x01""judgment.\x04""Back then, people called us\x01""great composers because of our\x01""many musical masterpieces.\x04""But we brothers were not just\x01""composers.\x04""Our mission was to analyze the\x01""mysterious powers of Hyrule's\x01""Royal Family.\x04""Our names would be part of\x01""Hyrule's history if we completed\x01""our research!\x04""We kept our study extremely\x01""secret until we completed it.\x01""Secret from men like you.\x07""P\x14""\x02""" } },
{ 0x5013, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x08""GYAAAAH! I'M DEAD AGAIN!\x01""What? You again?\x04""Somehow, you carry the scent\x01""of Princess Zelda.\x04""If the Royal Family truly trusts\x01""you, I will tell you a little more\x01""of our story. Goddesses forgive\x01""me.\x07""P\x14""\x02""" } },
{ 0x5014, { 0, 0, "Each of us studied a different\x01""song: one to summon the sun\x01""and another to summon the\x01""moon.\x04""If you were truly sent by the\x01""Royal Family, I will tell you what\x01""we found.\x04""We inscribed it on the royal\x01""tombstone.\x04""Show your Royal credentials on\x01""top of the Triforce mark... if\x01""you really have them.\x07""P\x11""\x02""" } },
{ 0x5015, { 0, 0, "Z Z Z...\x04""Malon... doing all right...\x01""Mumble... mumble... Sorry to\x01""make you worry...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5016, { 0, 0, "Ingo took over Lon Lon Ranch.\x01""They call it Ingo Ranch\x01""nowadays. And he did it to\x01""please YOU.\x04""I was kicked out, and look at\x01""me now! My girl Malon still\x01""works at the ranch...\x04""I'm worried about her... Please\x01""leave her alone.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5017, { 0, 0, "You... saved Malon? You, of all\x01""people? Thanks! I'm goin' back\x01""to the ranch, then! Yeehah!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5018, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x08""Hey! Don't mess around with\x01""the graves! ...Eep. You're a big\x01""one.\x04""I'm the Gravekeeper! My face\x01""may be scary, but not as scary\x01""as yours!\x04""Let me give you an ad for my\x01""side business...\x04""The Gravekeeper's\x01""Heart-Pounding Gravedigging\x01""Tour!\x04""What's gonna come out?!\x01""What's gonna come out?! When\x01""I start digging, we'll find out!\x07""P\x19""\x02""" } },
{ 0x501A, { 0, 3, "\x05""ANope, nothing here!\x02""" } },
{ 0x501B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Get back, Ganondorf!\x02""" } },
{ 0x501C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf... A terrible thing has\x01""happened! The evil shadow\x01""spirit has been released!\x04""Impa, leader of Kakariko Village,\x01""had sealed it in the bottom of\x01""the well...\x04""But it grew so strong that the\x01""seal broke, and it escaped into\x01""the world!!\x04""...If it has anything to do with\x01""you, I swear...\x02""" } },
{ 0x501D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Let me take care of the village!\x01""You go! And for once, use that\x01""power to protect someone!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5022, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The one who carries the noble\x01""Zelda's Ocarina... As I feared,\x01""you have come.\x04""I am Impa, one of the Sheikah. I\x01""am Princess Zelda's caretaker,\x01""and the Sage who guards the\x01""Shadow Temple.\x04""I have watched you since you\x01""were a boy, Gerudo. I am\x01""watching you still.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5024, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Ganondorf...\x04""Finally, all six Sages have\x01""awakened. The time for the final\x01""showdown with the King of Evil\x01""has come.\x04""...However that showdown ends,\x01""with you.\x04""Before that, you should meet\x01""the one who is waiting for\x01""you...\x04""The one who is waiting at the\x01""Temple of Time...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5025, { 0, 3, "\x1A""We Sheikah have served\x01""Hyrule's royalty from generation\x01""to generation as attendants.\x01""However...\x04""On that day seven years ago,\x01""YOU suddenly attacked... and\x01""Hyrule Castle fell in a short\x01""time.\x04""Your target was one of the\x01""keys to the Sacred Realm, the\x01""hidden treasure of the Royal\x01""Family: the Ocarina of Time!\x04""My duty bound me to take\x01""Zelda out of your reach.\x04""When last I saw you, as we fled\x01""the castle, you were already a\x01""terror...\x04""And now you come to us, the\x01""Sages... I do not understand\x01""what game you play.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5026, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I have to stay here... Go to\x01""Princess Zelda's side and\x01""protect her on my behalf. If you\x04""harm her, every Sheikah alive\x01""will hunt you.\x04""Now I put my power into this\x01""Medallion. Use it well.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5027, { 0, 0, "How is your Cucco? Is he\x01""happy? Shall I check him out for\x01""you? He's not scared of you, at\x01""least.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5028, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x12""hUI am the boss of the carpenters\x01""Impa hired to make this village\x01""into a true city!\x04""But young men these days don't\x01""have any ambition... Not like\x01""you. Too much ambition, you.\x04""My workers just run aimlessly\x01""around the village, and they're\x01""not making any progress at all...\x04""Even my own son doesn't have\x01""a job! He just wanders around\x01""all day!\x07""P)\x02""" } },
{ 0x5029, { 0, 0, "\x1A""They're all worthless, I tell\x01""you!! Please don't conquer us.\x02""" } },
{ 0x502A, { 0, 0, "Look at that poor girl over\x01""there. She works so hard on\x01""her chickens, even though\x04""touching them gives her goose\x01""bumps...\x04""What a trooper! I'd really like\x01""to help her! I've just been\x01""feeling so charitable these\x04""days! Don't you feel that way,\x01""too? No, I guess not.\x02""" } },
{ 0x502B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""There's nothing to worry\x01""about... The Princess is safe\x01""now. Out of your reach.\x02""" } },
{ 0x502C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Soon you'll meet Princess Zelda\x01""face to face, and she will\x01""explain everything...\x04""That is when we, the six Wise\x01""Ones, will seal up the Evil King\x01""and return peace to Hyrule.\x04""...Strange to say that to your\x01""face.\x02""" } },
{ 0x502D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hehehe, Gerudo... You kept up\x01""with me! You're fast for such a\x01""big man! Hehehe!\x04""As a reward, I'll give you my\x01""treasure. It's called the\x01""Hookshot!\x04""Its spring-loaded chain pulls you\x01""to any spot where its hook\x01""sticks. Doesn't that sound cool?\x01""I'm sure it will help you!\x04""I live here now, so come back\x01""sometime. I'll give you\x01""something cool!\x04""One more thing! Be careful on\x01""your way back! Heheheh... I died\x01""of fright once already.\x02""" } },
{ 0x502E, { 0, 0, "You're back, Gerudo... Was my\x01""present fun and useful?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5030, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Looks like you're coming\x01""around...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5031, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Impa has gone to the Shadow\x01""Temple to seal it again, but...\x01""she will be in danger without\x01""any help.\x04""Impa is one of the six Sages.\x01""Destroy the evil shadow spirit\x01""and save Impa. Prove that you\x01""can.\x04""There is an entrance to the\x01""Shadow Temple beneath the\x01""graveyard behind this village.\x04""All I can do for you is teach\x01""you the melody that leads to\x01""the Shadow Temple...\x04""It will draw you into the infinite\x01""darkness that absorbs even\x01""time... You know darkness well.\x04""Listen to this, the Nocturne of\x01""Shadow!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5032, { 0, 0, "Go around! Go around and\x01""around and around! What fun!\x01""I'm so happy!\x04""I'm a music man who loves to\x01""go around and around! Go\x01""around and around!!!\x04""I'm trying to come up with a\x01""musical theme inspired by this\x01""windmill... going around and\x01""around!!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5033, { 0, 0, "Go around, go around, go\x01""around... What? It's going way\x01""too fast!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5034, { 0, 0, "Grrrrrrrrr!\x04""I'll never forget what happened\x01""on that day, seven years ago!\x01""Grrrrrrrrr!\x04""It's all that Ocarina player's\x01""fault! Next time he comes\x01""around here, I'm gonna... uh...\x04""You're not him, are you? You're\x01""bigger than I remember.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5035, { 0, 3, "\x1A""What?! You've got an ocarina!!\x04""What the heck!\x04""That reminds me of that time,\x01""seven years ago!\x04""Back then a big, mean kid came\x01""here and played a strange song.\x01""It messed up this windmill! ...He\x01""looked a lot like you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5036, { 0, 0, "What should I do!? My Cuccos\x01""have all flown away!\x04""You, sir... Please! Please help\x01""me bring them back to this\x01""pen! You look like you could\x01""scare them back in!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5037, { 0, 0, "My Cuccos have run away!\x01""Please help me bring the other\x01""four back to this pen! Please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5038, { 0, 0, "My Cuccos have run away!\x01""Please help me bring the other\x01""three back to this pen! Please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5039, { 0, 0, "My Cuccos have run away!\x01""Please help me bring the other\x01""two back to this pen! Please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x503A, { 0, 0, "My Cuccos have run away!\x01""Please help me bring the last\x01""one back to this pen! Please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x503D, { 0, 0, "Please don't tease my Cuccos!\x01""Or eat them!\x02""" } },
{ 0x503E, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I bred a new type of miniature\x01""Cucco! I call it the Pocket\x01""Cucco! I don't get goose bumps\x01""from this baby.\x04""Cuccos are very good at\x01""getting lazy, late-risers out of\x01""bed. Haven't you heard of them\x01""before?\x04""It makes them very happy to\x01""crow: CUCCKOOOO! especially\x01""when it wakes a very heavy\x01""sleeper!\x04""However, my Cucco isn't\x01""entirely happy right now...\x04""You... You look like you're good\x01""at handling... well, everything.\x01""By force.\x04""Here, take this egg. After the\x01""Cucco hatches, bring it back to\x01""me after a while, and I'll check\x01""its mood. Gently!\x07""P?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5041, { 0, 0, "Heh heh heh, Gerudo! Are you\x01""fast on your feet?\x04""I may not look like it, but I'm\x01""confident in my speed! Let's\x01""have a race! Follow me if you\x01""dare!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5042, { 0, 0, "Please make my Cucco happy!\x01""OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5043, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh, your Cucco looks pretty\x01""happy! He must have awakened\x01""an extremely lazy guy!\x04""You're a good Cucco Keeper.\x01""Who'd have thought? I'll give\x01""you a rare, valuable Cucco, if\x01""you're interested...\x04""Its name is Cojiro, and it used\x01""to be my brother's Cucco. Its\x01""blue body is quite charming.\x04""Since my brother has gone,\x01""strangely, Cojiro has stopped\x01""crowing.\x07""PD\x02""" } },
{ 0x5047, { 0, 0, "My brother must have been\x01""very lonely...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5048, { 0, 0, "I hear the Lost Woods, where\x01""fairies live, is a strange place\x01""with many mysterious smells.\x04""I wish I could just once make\x01""medicine with the strange\x01""things I might find there...\x04""I can't see very well anymore,\x01""but my nose still works fine!\x01""And you smell like sand and\x01""sorcery. Hehehe!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5049, { 0, 0, "Sniff sniff sniff...\x04""What a mysterious smell...\x04""You must have something!\x02""" } },
{ 0x504A, { 0, 0, "That bum! He had to go into\x01""the forest... I see.\x07""PK\x02""" } },
{ 0x504C, { 0, 0, "How sad... I just need a little...\x02""" } },
{ 0x504F, { 0, 0, "They say there's no medicine\x01""that can cure a fool... or a\x01""tyrant. I guess that's true...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5050, { 0, 0, "I can't get down, so all I can do\x01""is look at Death Mountain.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5051, { 0, 0, "I can't get down, so all I can do\x01""is look at the stars. And\x01""they're safer than looking at\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5052, { 0, 0, "Can you see it from there?\x01""Something is happening on\x01""Death Mountain! ...You did it,\x01""didn't you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5053, { 0, 0, "Can you see it from there?\x01""Death Mountain is back to\x01""normal!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5054, { 0, 0, "I don't feel like getting down,\x01""ever! Not with you down\x01""there! I'll keep watching Death\x01""Mountain from up here.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5055, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hey! Good to see you again... I\x01""think. I'll give you this as a\x01""memento.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5057, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hey! Do you always barge into\x01""other people's houses? Didn't\x01""those twin witches who raised\x01""you teach you any manners?\x04""Oh well.\x04""Did you see a lady behind this\x01""house? She's going through hard\x01""times. Leave her be.\x04""Oh well.\x07""PX\x02""" } },
{ 0x5058, { 0, 3, "If that lady asks you about\x01""chickens, you should listen to\x01""her.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5059, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Is barging into houses at this\x01""hour your idea of fun? You\x01""must not have had a good\x01""upbringing.\x04""Oh well.\x07""PZ\x02""" } },
{ 0x505A, { 0, 3, "That lady takes care of\x01""chickens, but she's actually\x01""allergic to them.\x04""Oh well.\x02""" } },
{ 0x505B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hey! Barging into a person's\x01""house without permission?!\x01""...Oh. Oh no. It's you.\x04""Oh well.\x04""This isn't even my house. This is\x01""the great Impa's house!\x04""The great Impa has gone to the\x01""graveyard to seal up the\x01""humongous creature there.\x04""Since YOU appeared, many\x01""monsters have been sighted\x01""around here.\x04""Only the great Impa has kept\x01""peace in our village. You\x01""remember that!\x04""Oh well.\x04""Speaking of the great Impa, she\x01""hasn't come back yet. I wonder\x01""what happened to her...\x07""P\\\x02""" } },
{ 0x505C, { 0, 3, "I heard the ghost of the\x01""gravekeeper often appears in\x01""the graveyard behind this\x01""village...\x04""But no big deal. You're scarier.\x02""" } },
{ 0x505D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hi... Is this your first time\x01""visiting this village, big man?\x04""A great woman, Impa, opened\x01""up this village to us poor folk.\x07""P^\x02""" } },
{ 0x505E, { 0, 3, "Well, make yourself at home.\x01""Please don't take it, though. The\x01""food isn't ready yet, either.\x02""" } },
{ 0x505F, { 0, 3, "The great Impa is not here. Did\x01""something happen to her? Did\x01""YOU happen to her?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5060, { 0, 3, "\x1A""All people have hardships in\x01""their past that they'd rather no\x01""one found out about. Even you,\x01""I bet.\x07""Pa\x02""" } },
{ 0x5061, { 0, 3, "Look at the bearded man\x01""sleeping over there. I bet even\x01""someone like him has had his\x01""share of troubles in the past...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5062, { 0, 3, "That bearded guy went back to\x01""the ranch. He looked so happy!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5066, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hey, what are you doing\x01""wandering around this late at\x01""night?\x04""Oh, I get it. You're testing your\x01""courage, aren't you? You must\x01""want to go to... a graveyard!\x01""You'd fit right in!\x04""Wait a minute! What am I doing\x01""talking to you? I've got work to\x01""do! Work! Far away from you!\x07""Pg\x02""" } },
{ 0x5068, { 0, 0, "There's a strange guy living in\x01""the Windmill. Have you already\x01""met him, your... um... sir?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5069, { 0, 0, "People are disgusting. My own\x01""father and mother are\x01""disgusting. You must be\x04""disgusting too! ...You definitely\x01""are.\x02""" } },
{ 0x506A, { 0, 0, "All day long we work on\x01""construction projects in the\x01""village. It's going to take a\x01""while before everything's done.\x04""Our boss works us very hard!\x01""But not as hard as you'd work\x01""us, I bet.\x02""" } },
{ 0x506B, { 0, 3, "I'm starving! Let's eat dinner,\x01""right now! Not with you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x506C, { 0, 3, "Those guys each do the work of\x01""half a man, but they still want a\x01""full man's portion! They're lazy\x01""slackers, I tell you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5070, { 0, 0, "My Cuccos have run away!\x01""Please catch six more!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5072, { 0, 0, "I'm still missing some Cuccos!\x01""Please round up five more!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5074, { 0, 3, "Look at this! My beautiful,\x01""smooth hands are all worn out\x01""from working. Sob sob... Your\x04""hands look like they've never\x01""worked a day!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5075, { 0, 0, "A job where you can make a\x01""lot of money without much\x01""effort... The only thing I can\x04""think of is thievery... You'd\x01""know, King of Thieves. Is that a\x01""bad idea?\x02""" } },
{ 0x5076, { 0, 3, "I heard our boss's house is just\x01""behind this house. He doesn't\x01""want any of us to know, though.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5079, { 0, 0, "\x1A""This used to be the great\x01""Impa's house, but she doesn't\x01""live here any longer.\x04""It's now open to all villagers.\x01""You are... free to go in, I\x01""suppose.\x07""Pz\x02""" } },
{ 0x507A, { 0, 0, "This village used to be a\x01""Sheikah village, but the great\x01""Impa opened it to everyone.\x01""Well, almost everyone.\x02""" } },
{ 0x507B, { 0, 0, "I tell you, I saw him!\x04""I saw the ghostly figure of the\x01""gravekeeper sinking into his\x01""grave. He was holding some\x01""kind of treasure!\x02""" } },
{ 0x507C, { 0, 0, "There he is! It's him! The one\x01""who dropped from the sky\x01""surrounded by a blue light!\x01""...And he's the KING OF EVIL!\x04""Now do you believe me?\x02""" } },
{ 0x507D, { 0, 0, "Nobody believes what I've been\x01""telling them these past seven\x01""years!\x02""" } },
{ 0x507E, { 0, 0, "The fire almost consumed us all!\x01""But together, we put it out!\x01""Your fire, by the way. We\x01""know.\x02""" } },
{ 0x507F, { 0, 0, "Wah hah hah hah hah hah!\x04""Look at this guy! Ever since he\x01""escaped from Castle Town, he's\x01""been even more timid! And\x01""now YOU show up!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5080, { 0, 0, "Wah hah hah hah hah hah! He\x01""must have been seeing things!\x01""...Oh. He wasn't. Hah... hah...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5081, { 0, 3, "Wah hah hah hah hah hah! Those\x01""are some funny-looking clothes,\x01""man! ...Please don't kill me.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5082, { 0, 3, "Wah hah hah hah hah hah! When\x01""times are tough, laughter is the\x01""best medicine! And you've made\x01""times VERY tough!\x02""" } },
{ 0x5083, { 0, 0, "Look at me! I'm on top of the\x01""world! It really bothers me to\x01""see anyone higher up than me!\x04""I have to be on top! ...You\x01""can't have the roof.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5084, { 0, 0, "If I fall asleep up here, I'll\x01""surely fall down...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5085, { 0, 0, "The windmill draws water up\x01""from the depths of the well.\x04""Now the well is dried up,\x01""though. Hrrrrm... Things have\x01""been bad since you came.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5086, { 0, 3, "The lady here is really\x01""generous. She even took care\x01""of the carpenters when they\x04""were here! She'd probably feed\x01""you, too. That's how generous.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5087, { 0, 0, "A long time ago, a man in this\x01""very village had an eye they\x01""said could see the truth!\x04""Usually you have to train your\x01""mind's eye most strenuously to\x01""actually see the truth...\x04""But they say this fella had a\x01""different way of doing things...\x04""His house stood where the well\x01""is now...\x02""" } },
{ 0x5088, { 0, 3, "Folks around here tell of a\x01""fabulously rich family that once\x01""lived in one of the houses in\x01""this village...\x04""They say the whole family was\x01""cursed for their greed!\x04""Who knows what might happen\x01""to those consumed by greed...\x01""You might want to think about\x01""that.\x02""" } },
{ 0x5089, { 0, 0, "Heh...\x04""What an annoying brute,\x01""interrupting us like this... Don't\x01""you agree, my love?\x02""" } },
{ 0x508A, { 0, 0, "Hee hee...\x04""Violating our personal space!\x01""He must have a kingdom to ruin\x01""somewhere else... Don't you\x01""agree, darling?\x02""" } },
{ 0x508B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Look at him... the man with the\x01""beard. I think he was fired from\x01""his job at the ranch... because\x01""of your man Ingo.\x07""P\x8C""\x02""" } },
{ 0x508C, { 0, 3, "He's always just lazing around,\x01""morning, noon and night. An\x01""awfully carefree guy, in times\x01""you made so hard.\x02""" } },
{ 0x508D, { 0, 3, "That lazy man kind of reminded\x01""me of my little Richard...\x04""What's that? You've never\x01""heard of my little Richard? He\x01""was such a famous puppy!\x04""You've seriously never heard of\x01""him? You must not get out of\x01""the desert much.\x02""" } },
{ 0x508E, { 0, 0, "Oh, no! A storm again!! You\x01""played the Ocarina again, didn't\x01""you!! Grrrrrrrrrrrrrrr!! I'm not\x01""scared of you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6000, { 0, 2, "\x08""Halt! Stay where you are! ...My\x01""king?! Forgive me!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6001, { 0, 0, "Hail, King of the Gerudo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6002, { 0, 0, "Hail, my king! Wait a moment\x01""and I'll open the gate for you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6003, { 0, 2, "\x08""Don't take us so lightly, even\x01""you, my king!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6005, { 0, 0, "From now on, my king, the gate\x01""to the desert is yours to pass\x01""as you please.\x04""You'll find the Spirit Temple,\x01""where Nabooru stays, out in the\x01""desert. She does not bow to\x01""you... yet.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6006, { 0, 2, "\x08""Forgive us, my king! The twins'\x01""orders! Get in there and keep\x01""quiet... Your Majesty.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6007, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I have no idea how you got in\x01""here, but you must have a lot\x01""of guts to make it past all the\x01""guards around here!\x04""...Wait. The guards SALUTE you.\x01""You're the Gerudo King! Oh no,\x01""oh no!\x04""All my fellow carpenters are\x01""imprisoned somewhere in here.\x04""If you get us out of here, we'll\x01""repay you somehow! Please\x01""don't add us to your collection!\x04""Be careful! There're sure to be\x01""Gerudo guards around here...\x01""though I guess they work for\x01""you.\x04""Woo! Watch out!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x600C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Past, present, future...\x04""The Master Sword is a ship\x01""with which you can sail\x01""upstream and downstream\x04""through time's river... I never\x01""thought it would accept a hand\x01""like yours.\x04""Its port is in the Temple of\x01""Time...\x04""To restore the Desert Colossus\x01""and enter the Spirit Temple,\x01""you must travel back through\x01""time's flow...\x04""Listen to this Requiem of\x01""Spirit... This melody will lead a\x01""child back to the desert. Even\x01""the child you once were.\x02""" } },
{ 0x600E, { 0, 0, "You have guts, my king. Of\x01""course you do. Follow me.\x02""" } },
{ 0x600F, { 0, 0, "It's out of the question if you\x01""don't have a horse! Even for\x01""the king!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6010, { 0, 0, "\x08""I won't have anything to do\x01""with a coward! ...Not that you\x01""are one, my king. But rules are\x01""rules.\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6011, { 0, 0, "Ah, you are not as good as\x01""they say, my king. Maybe next\x01""time.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6012, { 0, 0, "You did well, my king.\x04""For today, I admit I lost. Your\x01""blood runs true. It seems I have\x01""a lot of room for improvement.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6013, { 0, 0, "This is the Gerudo's Training\x01""Ground.\x04""Nobody may enter without a\x01""membership card... not even the\x01""king. Tradition!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6016, { 0, 0, "You don't have enough money!\x01""Come back again, my king.\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6017, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hail, my king!\x04""Are you going into the desert?\x01""I'll open this gate for you, but...\x04""Not even the king crosses the\x01""desert without passing the two\x01""trials.\x07""`\x18""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6019, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Why did you come all the way\x01""down here? What? You were\x01""just about to ask me the same\x01""thing?\x07""`\x1A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x601A, { 0, 0, "Well, now that you're down\x01""here, you may as well make the\x01""best of things!\x02""" } },
{ 0x601B, { 0, 0, "Good man! Thanks! I'm sorry I\x01""can't give you something as\x01""good in return, but... take this\x04""anyway! Please don't conquer\x01""me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x601E, { 0, 0, "The temple is no place for you,\x01""Gerudo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x601F, { 0, 0, "A Sage? I don't know anyone\x01""like that. And I wouldn't tell\x01""YOU.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6021, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Wha-ha-ha! Don't try to act\x01""cool. I was just asking!\x04""Of course I know who you are,\x01""little king. Every Gerudo does.\x04""Well, let's cut to the chase...\x07""`#\x02""" } },
{ 0x6022, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Uh-huh!\x04""You've got guts, I'll give you\x01""that. Must run in the blood.\x07""`#\x02""" } },
{ 0x6023, { 0, 0, "\x1A""First, let me introduce myself.\x01""I'm Nabooru of the Gerudo. I'm a\x01""lone wolf thief.\x04""But don't get me wrong!\x04""Though we're both thieves, I'm\x01""nothing like the man you'll grow\x01""into.\x04""Your followers steal from\x01""women and children, and they\x01""even kill people!\x04""The Gerudo are all women. Only\x01""one man is born every hundred\x01""years. That's you.\x04""Our laws say the lone male\x01""Gerudo must become King of\x01""the Gerudo... but I'll never bow\x01""to an evil man. Not even you.\x04""By the way, what do you call\x01""yourself these days?\x04""\x0F""?!\x04""What kind of name is that?\x01""Well... anyway...\x07""`$\x02""" } },
{ 0x6025, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Thanks... my king. Ha!\x04""You and I, let's give your\x01""followers a big surprise, shall\x01""we? Let's see whose side\x01""you're really on.\x07""`&\x02""" } },
{ 0x6026, { 0, 0, "If you can get the Silver\x01""Gauntlets...\x04""I'll do something great for you!\x01""Even you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6027, { 0, 0, "Well, what did I expect? After\x01""all, you're only the king of\x01""thieves!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6028, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hey! Where are you taking\x01""me?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6029, { 0, 1, "\x1A""Ho ho ho! Looks like someone\x01""is here, Koume.\x02""" } },
{ 0x602A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hee hee hee! Looks like it,\x01""Kotake! ...Wait. Isn't that our\x01""boy?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x602B, { 0, 1, "\x1A""What an outrageous fellow,\x01""intruding so boldly into our\x01""Temple... Ho ho ho! He takes\x01""after us!\x02""" } },
{ 0x602C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""We should teach this outrageous\x01""fellow a lesson anyway! Hee\x01""hee hee! For his own good!\x02""" } },
{ 0x602D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Oh, loyal minion...\x02""" } },
{ 0x602E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Destroy this intruder on our\x01""behalf! Gently! He's family!\x02""" } },
{ 0x602F, { 0, 1, "\x1A""Great Ganondorf's... Enemy...\x01""Must die... Great Ganondorf...\x01""is... the enemy...?\x02""" } },
{ 0x6030, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Unnnh... Where am I...?\x02""" } },
{ 0x6031, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Well, well... Looks like she's\x01""back to normal... Koume...\x02""" } },
{ 0x6032, { 0, 3, "\x1A""She's just a little girl, but she\x01""commands a lot of respect\x01""among the Gerudo, Kotake...\x01""more than our boy, sometimes.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6033, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Maybe we should make her work\x01""for the great Ganondorf a little\x01""while longer! He's standing right\x01""there! Ho ho ho!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6034, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Then we should brainwash her\x01""again! For our dear boy! Hee\x01""hee hee!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6035, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Let me thank you, Ganondorf.\x01""Heheheh... Look what the little\x01""king has become in seven\x01""years--a monster with a sword!\x04""...And yet you came to save\x01""me.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6037, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Here, take this... It's very\x01""important to me. Let's have a\x01""competition later. I want to see\x04""if you're as good as you are\x01""cruel.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6038, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf... see you again. As\x01""enemies, or not.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6039, { 0, 3, "\x1A""By the way...\x04""I really messed up...\x04""Those old witches brainwashed\x01""me, and I was used to do YOUR\x01""evil will...\x04""But isn't it funny? That a\x01""person like me could turn out\x01""to be the Sage of Spirit!\x04""And now I'll fight them as one\x01""of the six Sages! Heh heh...\x04""I'm going to pay them back for\x01""what they did to me. And if\x01""you're next, so be it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x603A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf...\x04""No... King of the Gerudo. For\x01""once the title fits.\x04""Instead of keeping the promise I\x01""made back then, I give you this\x01""Medallion!\x04""Take it! And remember who\x01""gave it to you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x603B, { 0, 2, "\x1A""\x08""Yeearggh! Let me go!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x603C, { 0, 2, "\x1A""You fiends! Ganondorf's\x01""minions! Your own king is\x01""standing right there!\x02""" } },
{ 0x603D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x08""Ganondorf! Get out of here!\x01""Now!\x02""" } },
{ 0x603E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""These witches! They're using\x01""black magic on me! Your\x01""mothers, Ganondorf!\x02""" } },
{ 0x603F, { 0, 0, "Hail, my king! This is our\x01""horseback archery field.\x04""After a lot of hard practice and\x01""training, we can hit the\x01""bull's-eye while riding like the\x01""wind!\x04""When you have a horse, come\x01""back and try it. Every Gerudo\x01""would love to see their king\x01""shoot!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6044, { 0, 0, "Magnificent! You are a true\x01""master, my king!\x04""I will give you an item suitable\x01""for a master.\x04""This quiver is very important to\x01""me. I want my king to have it.\x01""Take good care of it!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6046, { 0, 0, "Fantastic! You are the ultimate\x01""master! The valley will sing of\x01""this!\x04""I will give you this item. With\x01""this equipment, the only thing\x01""left to improve is yourself, my\x01""king!\x02""" } },
{ 0x605B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""D-did you come here to save\x01""me? The Gerudo King himself?\x01""Oh, that's just... swell. I'm Ichiro\x01""the carpenter.\x04""We wanted to join their\x01""all-female group, but they locked\x01""us up because we're men!\x04""...You're a man too, and they\x01""BOW to you! It's not fair!\x04""Three of my fellows have also\x01""been captured. Please help them\x01""escape too!\x02""" } },
{ 0x605C, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Th-thank you for coming to save\x01""me, sir! I'm Jiro, the carpenter.\x04""These women are so scary!\x01""And YOU'RE their king! I'd\x01""rather work as a carpenter than\x01""join them!\x04""I can't wait to say goodbye to\x01""this place! Two of my buddies\x01""are still being held prisoner.\x04""Will you please get them out\x01""too?\x02""" } },
{ 0x605D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Thanks... Your Majesty? You're\x01""fantastic! I'm Sabooro, the\x01""carpenter.\x04""Have you seen our boss? He's\x01""probably worried about me! I\x01""have to get back to him right\x01""away!\x04""One more of our workers is\x01""still a prisoner. Please save\x01""him!\x02""" } },
{ 0x605E, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I was afraid you'd forget about\x01""me! Now I'm free! Thanks! I'm\x01""Shiro the carpenter.\x04""For rescuing me, I'll tell you\x01""something interesting I\x01""overheard your Gerudo talking\x01""about.\x04""They said, \"To cross the\x01""Haunted Wasteland, you'll need\x01""the 'eye of truth.' The Colossus\x04""is on the far side of the\x01""wasteland...\"\x04""OK, I'm going back to my tent\x01""near Gerudo Valley, so drop by\x01""sometime. You may find\x01""something helpful there! Byeee!\x02""" } },
{ 0x605F, { 0, 3, "The leader of the gang of\x01""thieves is Nabooru. She's\x01""experimenting with brainwashing\x04""many people at the ruins in the\x01""desert.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6060, { 0, 3, "Oh, so it was YOU, the Evil\x01""King, behind the gang of\x01""thieves...\x02""" } },
{ 0x6061, { 0, 3, "\x1A""When Nabooru was a lone wolf\x01""thief, she never stole from the\x01""weak, but...\x07""`b\x02""" } },
{ 0x6062, { 0, 3, "Now Nabooru's gang of thieves\x01""stands for cruelty and brutality.\x01""She claims to be a chivalrous\x04""robber, but... no way! That's\x01""YOUR doing!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6063, { 0, 3, "Like I suspected, Nabooru was\x01""brainwashed by your followers...\x02""" } },
{ 0x6064, { 0, 3, "\x1A""In Gerudo society, those with\x01""great skill in horseback riding\x01""and archery are well respected.\x01""Even more than kings, they say.\x07""`e\x02""" } },
{ 0x6065, { 0, 3, "How about trying horseback\x01""archery at the Gerudo's\x01""Fortress?\x04""If you have a horse, a Gerudo\x01""from the fortress will set up\x01""your challenge. They'd never\x01""refuse their king.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6066, { 0, 3, "You did so great... uh... Your\x01""Majesty!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6067, { 0, 3, "Now that we're all back\x01""together, building a bridge over\x01""the valley was a piece of cake.\x01""Please don't burn it down.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6068, { 0, 3, "Without the old witches, the\x01""gang of thieves isn't all that\x01""scary! You still are, though.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6069, { 0, 0, "The Gerudo's Fortress is beyond\x01""this gate. Your fortress, I\x01""suppose. Go on in.\x02""" } },
{ 0x606A, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x12""hUI am a master craftsman. Your\x01""Gerudo thieves broke the\x01""bridge.\x04""I want to fix it, but all of my\x01""workers are gone!\x04""They said carpentry isn't cool,\x01""and they went to the Gerudo's\x01""Fortress to become thieves...\x01""YOUR thieves!\x07""`k\x02""" } },
{ 0x606B, { 0, 0, "Hey, you! If you're going to the\x01""fortress, would you find out\x01""what my workers are doing\x04""over there? Please don't keep\x01""them!\x02""" } },
{ 0x606C, { 0, 0, "Hey, I heard you saved my men.\x01""YOU did. When they came back,\x01""we built this bridge.\x04""Look at this! Isn't it a fine\x01""bridge?\x04""They may be wimpy carpenters,\x01""but once they got together,\x01""they got the job done. Please\x01""don't march an army over it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x606D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x12""hUHey, that saw! It's mine!\x04""But I thought I left that saw\x01""with my old lady... Oh well...\x07""`n\x02""" } },
{ 0x606F, { 0, 0, "\x08""What?! You're a dirty, rotten\x01""thief! Well, you ARE the King\x01""of Thieves...\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6070, { 0, 0, "This is the Gerudo's Training\x01""Ground. Unqualified persons are\x01""not allowed. Not even the king.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6072, { 0, 0, "This is the Gerudo's Training\x01""Ground. Even though you're\x01""qualified, don't hog all the\x04""treasure for yourself, my king!\x01""Leave some for your people!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6074, { 0, 0, "Oh, that's too bad.\x04""The mark that leads to the\x01""Spirit Temple is the flag on the\x01""left outside the shop.\x04""If you change your mind, please\x01""come back again!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6075, { 0, 0, "Ohh, not enough Rupees. No\x01""discounts, not even a Rupee.\x01""Not even for you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6076, { 0, 1, "Heh heh. You're already in the\x01""middle of something, aren't you.\x04""If you want to challenge me,\x01""come here with a clear mind. No\x01""other distractions! Not even\x01""conquest!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6078, { 0, 0, "Thank you very much!\x04""What I'm selling is... Bombchu!\x04""The mark that leads to the\x01""Spirit Temple is the flag on the\x01""left outside the shop. Be seeing\x01""you!\x02""" } },
{ 0x6079, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Hey, what's up, \x0F""?\x01""Surprised to see me?\x04""A long time in this world is\x01""almost nothing to you, is it?\x01""How mysterious!\x04""Even I thought the tales of\x01""someone who could travel back\x01""and forth through time were\x01""only legend.\x04""You have fully matured... into\x01""what, I still can't say.\x07""`z\x02""" } },
{ 0x607A, { 0, 3, "From now on, the future of all\x01""Hyrule's people is on your\x01""shoulders. Goddesses help them.\x04""Maybe it's not my time\x01""anymore. Here is my last\x01""advice.\x04""Two witches inhabit this temple.\x01""You know them well. To destroy\x01""them, turn their own magic\x01""power against them. Hoo hoot!\x07""`{\x02""" } },
{ 0x607C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I will continue to watch you...\x01""Very closely... Hoo hoo hoo\x01""hoot!\x02""" } },
{ 0x607D, { 0, 1, "\x1A""I'm the wandering running man!\x01""I've run all over this land in\x01""search of true competitive\x01""spirit.\x04""I beat all my challengers, man\x01""and beast.\x04""You're an athletic guy, and you\x01""definitely have a true killer\x01""instinct. Maybe too much.\x04""Now that the bridge over\x01""Gerudo Valley is complete, I'm\x01""looking for a challenger for a\x01""commemorative race.\x07""`~\x02""" } },
{ 0x607F, { 0, 1, "Excellent! Then...\x04""You go first. I'll give you a\x01""headstart.\x04""Now! Go ahead.\x14""\x00""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6080, { 0, 1, "Heh heh heh. You'll never\x01""discover your killer instinct with\x01""that kind of attitude. Hard to\x01""believe, coming from you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x6082, { 0, 1, "Heh heh heh. Please. Go ahead.\x14""\x00""\x02""" } },
{ 0x6086, { 0, 1, "I'm the wandering running man!\x01""I've run all over this land in\x01""search of competitors with a\x01""true killer instinct!\x04""I came here to run through the\x01""Haunted Wasteland, but it\x01""doesn't look like good timing for\x01""that.\x04""I want to go back to Hyrule\x01""Field, but the bridge is... well,\x01""you can see it from here. Your\x04""people broke it. So I'm stuck\x01""here, inside this tent.\x04""I don't think I can accept your\x01""challenge right now. Heh heh!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7000, { 0, 0, "I can't catch that Cucco! ...Eek!\x01""A Gerudo!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7001, { 0, 0, "Huff huff! I'm late! I'm late! For\x01""a very important date! Out of\x01""your way-- ...out of your way,\x01""PLEASE, sir!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7008, { 2, 0, "He's not moving anymore...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7009, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Can you see the man in that\x01""window? ...No. Of course not.\x01""You're standing right here.\x04""You are Ganondorf, leader of\x01""the Gerudo, who hail from the\x01""desert far to the west.\x04""You swear allegiance to my\x01""father, but I know you are not\x01""sincere.\x04""The dark clouds that covered\x01""Hyrule in my dream... They were\x01""you. I'm not afraid to say it to\x01""your face.\x02""" } },
{ 0x700D, { 0, 0, "What a strange shop! I wonder\x01""when it'll be open for business.\x01""I read the sign there, but it\x04""still seems weird! ...Please don't\x01""rob it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x700E, { 0, 0, "It seems like it's taking forever\x01""for dawn to come...\x04""The view of Hyrule Castle in\x01""the morning sun is so fantastic!\x01""...You're not going to take it,\x01""are you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x700F, { 0, 0, "To save the forest girl, you\x01""need another skill... Head to\x01""Kakariko Village!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7010, { 0, 0, "It looks like you have the skills\x01""you need... The forest girl is\x01""waiting for your help...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7011, { 0, 3, "If you want potions, you'd\x01""better bring an empty bottle.\x01""Understand, sir? Please don't\x01""be angry.\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7012, { 2, 3, "I'm sorry, but this is just a\x01""model. Because of the crisis in\x01""Goron City, we haven't received\x04""any shipments lately and we're\x01""out.\x04""...I heard you're the one who\x01""caused that crisis. Please don't\x01""tell anyone I said that.\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7013, { 0, 3, "If you plan on scaling Death\x01""Mountain, buy a Hylian Shield.\x01""It'll protect you from falling\x01""rocks.\x04""Not that rocks would dare fall\x01""on you, sir.\x0A""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7014, { 0, 0, "I'm not dancing, you know... My\x01""back itches! Ooh! Aaah!\x01""...Please stop staring at me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7015, { 0, 0, "They say we Hylians have big\x01""ears to hear the voices of the\x01""gods... Right now they're telling\x01""me to run from you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7016, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Have you been to Lon Lon\x01""Ranch, sir?\x04""Their milk is delicious! There\x01""are many horses there, and the\x01""ranch owner's daughter is cute!\x01""...Please leave her alone.\x07""p\x17""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7017, { 0, 0, "To get to Lon Lon Ranch, leave\x01""town and head due south across\x01""the field. You should visit at\x01""least once!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7018, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I wanted to see Princess Zelda!\x04""I avoided the guards...\x04""Swam through the moat...\x04""I was almost there when they\x01""caught me! ...They'd never catch\x01""YOU, I bet.\x07""p\x19""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7019, { 0, 0, "I found a small drain hole on\x01""the right side of the castle that\x01""I thought I could sneak into, but\x04""I got stuck there. You'd never\x01""fit, sir.\x02""" } },
{ 0x701A, { 0, 0, "Ahem! Hrrrm!\x04""This beard is my pride and joy!\x01""Doesn't it look luxuriant? ...Not\x01""as fiery as yours, of course.\x02""" } },
{ 0x701B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Ahem! Hrrrm!\x04""This beard is my pride and joy!\x01""Doesn't it look luxuriant?\x04""What?!\x04""You're looking for the guy from\x01""Lon Lon Ranch?\x04""Hmm, maybe...\x07""p\x1C""\x02""" } },
{ 0x701C, { 0, 0, "I saw a guy with a\x01""shabby-looking beard delivering\x01""some boxes to the castle.\x02""" } },
{ 0x701D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Do you know about the Temple\x01""of Time in the northeast part of\x01""town? Of course you do.\x04""Everyone says you've been\x01""sniffing around it.\x07""p\x1E""\x02""" } },
{ 0x701E, { 0, 0, "Legends say the Temple of Time\x01""is the entrance to the Sacred\x01""Realm...\x04""Did you know that? ...Forget I\x01""told you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x701F, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Wha-ha-ha! What a crazy guy!\x04""Can you believe this guy tried\x01""to sneak into the castle to see\x01""Princess Zelda?\x07""p \x02""" } },
{ 0x7020, { 0, 0, "Because of this idiot, they've\x01""tightened security at the castle.\x01""Wha-ha-hah! ...Not that it would\x01""stop you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7021, { 0, 0, "\x1A""I made a lot of money!\x04""Maybe I should go look for\x01""more things to sell! Somewhere\x01""far from you!\x07""p\"\x02""" } },
{ 0x7022, { 0, 0, "I know! I should go to Lake\x01""Hylia! Many things float down\x01""the river and end up there! Hah\x01""hah!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7023, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Hey, desert man! This is the\x01""city of Hyrule! Take your time\x01""and enjoy the sights... and\x01""please don't conquer them!\x07""p$\x02""" } },
{ 0x7024, { 0, 0, "If you came to see Hyrule\x01""Castle, take the street on your\x01""right.\x04""If you want to see the back\x01""alleys of the town, take the\x01""street to the left. Thieves like\x01""back alleys, right?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7025, { 0, 0, "Ohh...\x04""You are... so dangerous...\x04""Not like the King of Hyrule at\x01""all...\x04""Hee hee...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7026, { 0, 0, "Ohh...\x04""You are...\x04""more frightening...\x04""than anything I've ever seen...\x04""Ohh...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7027, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Have you heard the legend of\x01""the \"Shadow Folk\"?\x04""They are the Sheikah, the\x01""shadows of the Hylians.\x04""They swore allegiance to the\x01""King of Hyrule and guarded the\x01""Royal Family. They'd guard it\x01""from you.\x04""But with the long peace, no one\x01""has seen a Sheikah around here\x01""for a long time. However...\x07""p(\x02""" } },
{ 0x7028, { 0, 0, "I hear there is one Sheikah\x01""woman living in the castle... and\x01""she hates you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x702A, { 0, 0, "Z Z Z Z Z...\x04""Mumble mumble...\x04""Welcome... our ranch is so fun...\x04""C'mon and look around...\x02""" } },
{ 0x702B, { 0, 0, "\x1A""\x08""What in tarnation?\x04""Can't a person get a little\x01""shut-eye around here? ...Oh. Oh\x01""my. Sorry, sir.\x02""" } },
{ 0x703C, { 0, 0, "My attendant will guide you out\x01""of the castle. Don't be afraid to\x01""talk to her. She isn't afraid of\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x703D, { 0, 0, "The Spiritual Stone... You found\x01""it.\x04""They say the races that hold\x01""the Spiritual Stones open their\x01""minds only to one who knows\x01""the melody of the Royal Family.\x04""But you already know that,\x01""don't you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x703E, { 0, 0, "Have you heard that Princess\x01""Zelda sees prophetic visions in\x01""her dreams? They say she\x01""dreamed of you. A nightmare.\x02""" } },
{ 0x703F, { 0, 0, "Huh? What? Sh-shoo! Shoo,\x01""please!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7041, { 0, 0, "C'mon, can't you make it any\x01""cheaper? ...Oh, for HIM it's\x01""free?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7042, { 0, 0, "Hey, let go! It's mine! I found\x01""it first! ...Unless you want it,\x01""sir.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7043, { 0, 0, "Hey, who bumped me?! ...Never\x01""mind!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7044, { 0, 0, "We don't see a lot of Gerudo\x01""in these parts... Especially not\x01""THAT one. Something fishy is\x01""going on!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7045, { 0, 0, "Wasn't that Princess Zelda\x01""riding on the white horse?!\x01""Fleeing from... from... you?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7046, { 0, 0, "I almost got kicked by that\x01""black horse! YOUR black horse!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7047, { 0, 0, "That guy on the black horse... It\x01""was you! Ganondorf, the\x01""Gerudo King of Thieves!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7048, { 0, 0, "What happened?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7049, { 0, 0, "Look at that guy--he's so\x01""scared! What a wimp! Ha ha\x01""hah! ...Then again, it's you\x01""standing next to him.\x02""" } },
{ 0x704A, { 0, 0, "I have a feeling something\x01""terrible is going to happen...\x01""Maybe I should leave town\x01""soon. Like, right now.\x02""" } },
{ 0x704B, { 0, 0, "Something happened in the\x01""castle! You did something,\x01""didn't you?! I didn't see\x01""anything!\x02""" } },
{ 0x704C, { 0, 0, "With that key, proceed to the\x01""room ahead. Go, go!\x02""" } },
{ 0x704D, { 0, 0, "The one on the white horse\x01""holding the little girl... Wasn't\x01""that a legendary Sheikah? She\x01""was running from YOU!\x02""" } },
{ 0x704E, { 5, 2, "\x1A""\x0F""...\x04""Wake up... The one the Master\x01""Sword chose... though I cannot\x01""fathom why.\x02""" } },
{ 0x704F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I am Rauru, one of the ancient\x01""Sages...\x04""Ages ago, we built the Temple\x01""of Time to protect the entrance\x01""to the Sacred Realm... from men\x01""like you.\x04""This is the Chamber of Sages,\x01""inside the Temple of Light...\x04""The Temple of Light, in the very\x01""center of the Sacred Realm, is\x01""the last stronghold against your\x01""evil forces.\x04""The Master Sword--the\x01""evil-destroying sword you pulled\x01""from the Pedestal of Time--was\x04""the final key to the Sacred\x01""Realm. It should have burned\x01""your hand.\x04""Don't be alarmed... Look at\x01""yourself...!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7050, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""DLook at you! You're even bigger\x01""now!! You've grown up!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7052, { 0, 3, "It looks like you're confused...\x01""Let me tell you again, from the\x01""beginning.\x07""pQ\x02""" } },
{ 0x7053, { 0, 3, "\x1A""But remember...\x04""Though the Door of Time was\x01""opened...\x04""the Gerudo King of Thieves\x01""used it to enter this forbidden\x01""Sacred Realm. That man is you.\x04""You obtained the Triforce from\x01""the Temple of Light, and with\x01""its power you became the King\x01""of Evil...\x04""Your evil power radiated from\x01""the temples of Hyrule, and in\x01""seven short years it turned\x04""Hyrule into a world of\x01""monsters.\x04""My power now has little\x01""influence, even in this Sacred\x01""Realm...\x04""Only this Chamber of Sages.\x04""But there is still hope...\x04""The power of the Sages\x01""remains.\x04""When the power of all the\x01""Sages is awakened...\x04""The Sages' Seals will contain all\x01""evil power in the void of the\x01""Realm... Perhaps even yours.\x04""I, Rauru, am one of the Sages...\x01""And...\x04""You, the one the Master Sword\x01""chose, must fight together with\x01""the Sages. Whatever you are,\x01""that is now your fate.\x04""Keep my spirit with you... And\x01""find the power of the other\x01""Sages, and add their might to\x04""your own. Use it better than\x01""you used the Triforce.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7054, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""DWe're back in the Temple of\x01""Time... But have seven years\x01""really passed?\x04""It looks like you can't use some\x01""of the weapons you found as a\x01""child anymore...\x04""Let's get out of here!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7055, { 0, 0, "Heyyy, what...? What's wrong\x01""with loitering around all day?\x01""...Oh. Nothing, sir. Nothing at\x01""all.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7056, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I've been waiting for you,\x01""Ganondorf...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7057, { 0, 3, "\x1A""When evil rules all, an\x01""awakening voice from the\x01""Sacred Realm will call those\x04""destined to be Sages, who\x01""dwell in the five temples.\x04""One in a deep forest...\x04""One on a high mountain...\x04""One under a vast lake...\x04""One within the house of the\x01""dead...\x04""One inside a goddess of the\x01""sand...\x04""Together with the one chosen\x01""by the sword, the awakened\x01""ones will bind the evil and\x04""return the light of peace to the\x01""world...\x04""This is the legend of the\x01""temples passed down by my\x01""people, the Sheikah. I never\x01""thought I'd tell it to you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7059, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Use the Master Sword! Destroy\x01""Ganon with the sacred sword!\x02""" } },
{ 0x705A, { 0, 2, "\x1A""I have been waiting for you,\x01""Ganondorf.\x02""" } },
{ 0x705B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganondorf...\x04""You have overcome many\x01""hardships and awakened six\x01""Sages. I would never have\x01""believed it.\x04""And now you have a final\x01""challenge: a showdown with the\x01""King of Evil... with what you\x01""might have become.\x02""" } },
{ 0x705D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Seven years ago, the King of\x01""Thieves used the door that was\x01""opened in the Temple of Time\x01""and entered the Sacred Realm.\x04""But when he laid his hands on\x01""the Triforce, the legend came\x01""true.\x02""" } },
{ 0x705E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The one who holds the Triforce\x01""of Courage is... the one the\x01""sword chose. And yet the\x04""Triforce of Power still burns on\x01""your hand.\x02""" } },
{ 0x705F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""And the other, who holds the\x01""Triforce of Wisdom...\x04""is the seventh Sage, who is\x01""destined to lead them all...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7060, { 0, 3, "\x1A""It is I, the Princess of Hyrule,\x01""Zelda.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7061, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I apologize for meeting you in\x01""disguise, but I had to hide from\x01""the King of Evil. From you, I\x01""thought.\x04""I still don't know who you really\x01""are.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7063, { 0, 3, "\x1A""As long as the Ocarina was out\x01""of your reach, I thought the\x01""Sacred Realm was safe, but...\x04""something I could never expect\x01""happened...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7064, { 0, 3, "\x1A""That rumbling... It can't be!?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7067, { 2, 1, "\x1A""Can you hear me? It's Rauru,\x01""the Sage.\x04""We six will gather our power to\x01""create a bridge to the castle\x01""where the King of Evil dwells...\x04""The castle's keep, known as\x01""Ganon's Tower, is protected by\x01""six evil barriers.\x04""Bring down the six barriers and\x01""save Princess Zelda!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x706D, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Finish him off with the sword of\x01""time, the Master Sword!\x02""" } },
{ 0x706E, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh sealed door opened by the\x01""Sages... Close forever with the\x01""Evil Incarnation of Darkness\x01""within!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x706F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Thank you...\x04""Thanks to you, the darkness has\x01""been sealed inside the Evil\x01""Realm!\x04""Thus, peace will once again\x01""reign in this world... for a time.\x01""I never thought I'd owe it to\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7071, { 0, 0, "Do you really want to go\x01""through this gate that much?\x01""Let me think about it... OK, but\x01""in return...\x07""pr\x02""" } },
{ 0x7074, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You destroyed the wicked\x01""creatures that haunted the\x01""temple and awakened the Sage...\x04""But other Sages still need help.\x01""Strange that it falls to you.\x04""To awaken all the other Sages,\x01""you must become even more\x01""powerful. As if you needed\x01""more.\x04""You must travel over\x01""mountains...\x04""under water...\x04""and even through time...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7075, { 0, 3, "\x1A""As long as you hold the Ocarina\x01""of Time and the Master Sword,\x04""you hold time itself in your\x01""hands... Use it better than you\x01""once would have.\x04""We shall meet again,\x01""Ganondorf!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7077, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I am Sheik. Survivor of the\x01""Sheikah...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7078, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You stand there holding the\x01""Master Sword... The sword that\x01""seals evil, in the hands of the\x04""King of Evil. I don't understand\x01""it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7079, { 0, 3, "\x1A""If you believe the legend, you\x01""have no choice. You must find\x01""the five temples and awaken\x01""the five Sages...\x02""" } },
{ 0x707A, { 0, 3, "\x1A""One Sage waits for the time of\x01""awakening in the Forest Temple.\x01""A girl you know... one who\x01""called you a friend.\x04""Because of the evil power in\x01""the temple, she cannot hear the\x01""awakening call from the Sacred\x01""Realm...\x04""Equipped as you are, you cannot\x01""even enter the temple...\x04""But if you believe me, head to\x01""Kakariko Village...\x04""Do you understand, Ganondorf?\x02""" } },
{ 0x707C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Before that... there are things I\x01""want to tell only to you. Please\x01""listen.\x04""Another unknown legend of the\x01""Triforce, passed down by the\x01""Sheikah...\x02""" } },
{ 0x707D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The Triforce separated into\x01""three parts. Only the Triforce\x01""of Power remained in your hand.\x02""" } },
{ 0x707E, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The strength of the Triforce of\x01""Power made you a mighty, evil\x01""king, but your dark ambitions\x01""were not satisfied.\x02""" } },
{ 0x707F, { 0, 3, "\x1A""To gain complete mastery of\x01""the world, you began looking\x01""for those chosen by destiny to\x01""hold the other two parts.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7080, { 0, 3, "\x1A""On that day, seven years ago,\x01""you attacked Hyrule Castle.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7081, { 0, 3, "\x1A""After the door of time was\x01""opened, the Master Sword\x01""sealed its bearer away in the\x01""Sacred Realm...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7082, { 0, 3, "\x1A""That spirit remained in the\x01""Sacred Realm... and then the\x01""Triforce fell into your hands.\x01""You invaded the Sacred Realm...\x04""You became the Evil King, and\x01""the Sacred Realm became a\x01""world of evil. All of this was\x01""your doing.\x04""I passed myself off as a Sheikah\x01""and waited. For seven years.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7083, { 0, 3, "\x1A""And now you are back. The\x01""dark age you began... will you\x01""end it?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7084, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The six Sages will open the\x01""sealed door and lure the King\x01""of Evil back into the Sacred\x01""Realm.\x04""I will then seal the door to the\x01""Sacred Realm from this world.\x04""Thus the Evil King will vanish\x01""from Hyrule.\x04""To do this, I need your\x01""strength. Please protect me\x01""while I do my part. I can't\x01""believe I'm asking you.\x04""And here is a weapon that can\x01""penetrate the Evil King's\x01""defenses... The power given to\x01""the chosen ones...\x04""The sacred Arrow of Light!!!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7088, { 2, 0, "\x08""The Ocarina of Time opened the\x01""door. And with the Master\x01""Sword, he descended here.\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7089, { 0, 0, "It seems strange that packs of\x01""dogs roam our streets at\x01""night... Doesn't that seem weird\x04""to you? ...You're not the one\x01""letting them in, are you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x708A, { 0, 0, "Hey, big man, I'll tell you\x01""something helpful... just don't\x01""hurt me...\x04""I heard there's a mysterious\x01""fountain somewhere near the\x01""castle...\x02""" } },
{ 0x708B, { 0, 3, "\x1A""If you want to return to your\x01""original time, return the Master\x01""Sword to the Pedestal of Time.\x04""That will take you back in time\x01""seven years...\x02""" } },
{ 0x708C, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The time will come when you'll\x01""have to return here quickly... I'll\x01""teach you this for when that\x01""time comes...\x04""The song to return you to the\x01""Temple of Time... The Prelude of\x01""Light...\x02""" } },
{ 0x708D, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I am Impa of the Sheikah. I\x01""protect Princess Zelda. From\x01""you, until today.\x04""Everything is exactly as the\x01""Princess foretold. Though I\x01""hoped she was wrong about\x01""you.\x02""" } },
{ 0x708E, { 0, 0, "If the castle soldiers find you,\x01""there will be trouble. More for\x01""them than for you, I suspect.\x04""Let me lead you out of the\x01""castle.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7090, { 0, 3, "\x1A""You... are heading out on a big,\x01""new journey, aren't you?\x04""My role in the Princess's dream\x01""was to teach a melody to the\x01""one from the forest. She swore\x01""it was you. I pray she is right.\x04""This is an ancient melody\x01""passed down by the Royal\x01""Family.\x04""I have played this song for\x01""Princess Zelda as a lullaby ever\x01""since she was a baby...\x04""There is mysterious power in\x01""these notes.\x04""Now listen carefully... and never\x01""use it against her.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7091, { 0, 3, "\x1A""All the tragedy that has\x01""befallen Hyrule was my doing...\x04""I was so young... I could not\x01""grasp the consequences of\x01""trying to control the Sacred\x01""Realm.\x04""I trusted you. I dragged you\x01""into it. Now it is time for me\x01""to make up for my mistakes...\x04""You must lay the Master Sword\x01""to rest and close the Door of\x01""Time...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7092, { 0, 3, "\x1A""However, doing this will close\x01""the road between times...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7093, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Give the Ocarina to me...\x04""As a Sage, I can return you to\x01""your original time with it.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7094, { 0, 1, "\x1A""When peace returns to Hyrule...\x04""It will be time for us to say\x01""goodbye. Perhaps as something\x01""other than enemies.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7095, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Now go home, Ganondorf.\x01""Regain your lost time!\x04""Home... where you are supposed\x01""to be... and, I hope, who you\x01""are supposed to be.\x02""" } },
{ 0x709B, { 0, 0, "My precious little puppy's fur\x01""coat is very special compared\x01""to the other mutts around\x01""here! Don't you dare touch it!\x02""" } },
{ 0x709C, { 0, 0, "My precious puppy can run\x01""faster than any of the other\x01""mutts around here! Faster than\x01""you, too!\x02""" } },
{ 0x709D, { 0, 3, "I can't find my puppy anywhere!\x01""I need you to look for it!\x01""Please! ...Don't eat it!\x02""" } },
{ 0x709E, { 0, 3, "\x08""Arrrgh! That is not my dog!\x01""How could you mix up my puppy\x01""with a mutt like that?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x709F, { 0, 3, "\x08""Richard!\x04""This is my little Richard! Thank\x01""you! Thank you! I'll give you\x01""this as a reward! I always knew\x01""you weren't all bad!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70A0, { 0, 3, "At night it's dangerous to go\x01""out with all the wild dogs\x01""around... No, I wasn't warning\x04""you! You're the danger! I'm\x01""worried about my puppy!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70A4, { 0, 0, "I might have seen a cute little\x01""girl around here... Maybe she\x01""went to the castle? Who\x04""knows? Don't tell him I said\x01""that.\x02""" } },
{ 0x70C8, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The Triforce parts are\x01""resonating... They are combining\x01""into one again...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70CD, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x12""h_\x05""DI can't help you! Because of the\x01""waves of darkness, I can't get\x01""close!\x04""I'm sorry!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70CE, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The Great Evil King... beaten?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70CF, { 0, 3, "\x1A""...!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D0, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Ganon... pitiful beast...\x04""Without a strong, righteous\x01""mind, the power of the gods\x01""could not be controlled... and...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D1, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Listen to me! This tower will\x01""collapse soon!\x04""With his last breath, the Evil\x01""King is trying to crush us in\x01""the ruins of the tower! We\x01""need to hurry and escape!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D2, { 0, 3, "\x1A""Please follow me! Stay close!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D3, { 0, 3, "\x1A""It's over... it's finally over...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D4, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x05""DI'm sorry I couldn't help you in\x01""the battle before!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D5, { 0, 3, "\x1A""What is that sound?\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D6, { 0, 3, "\x1A""\x12""h_\x05""DThere's no way he's going to\x01""hold me back again! This time,\x01""we fight together! You and I.\x01""Who would have thought?\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D7, { 0, 3, "\x1A""The Master Sword is here!\x01""Hurry up!!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x70D8, { 0, 3, "\x1A""I'm using my power to hold the\x01""Evil King! You use your sword\x01""and deliver the final blow!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70E6, { 0, 3, "\x05""DIsn't that...?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70E8, { 0, 3, "\x08""\x05""DThe Master Sword!!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x70EA, { 0, 0, "That scary-looking man took off\x01""out of here really fast! ...You're\x01""scarier, though.\x02""" } },
{ 0x70EB, { 0, 0, "Oh so scary... Oh so scary... Oh\x01""so VERY scary...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70EC, { 0, 0, "Hey, what do you want? I don't\x01""have time to talk to y-- Oh!\x01""Plenty of time, sir! All the time\x01""you want!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70EE, { 0, 0, "No... That's not what I want... I\x01""want something inside a bottle...\x01""I didn't mean that thing...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70EF, { 0, 0, "No... I can't take that... That's\x01""not what I want to buy...\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F0, { 0, 0, "Oh, that's Blue Fire! I'll buy it\x01""for 150 Rupees! All sales final,\x01""OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F1, { 0, 0, "Oh, a Fish! I'll buy it for 100\x01""Rupees! All sales final, OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F2, { 0, 0, "Oh, it's a cute little Bug! I'll\x01""buy it for 50 Rupees! All sales\x01""final, OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F3, { 0, 0, "Oh, a darling little Fairy! I'll buy\x01""it for 25 Rupees! All sales final,\x01""OK?\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F4, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh... Oh my... It's YOU. The\x01""great Ganondorf himself, in my\x01""humble shop!\x04""Heh heh heh... I know your\x01""name. Who doesn't?\x04""Heh heh he... Don't be surprised.\x01""I can read people's minds. Yours\x01""is... delightfully dark.\x04""If I had a mind like yours, I\x01""could run a much bigger\x01""business... heh he heh...\x04""My shop is the only Ghost Shop\x01""in Hyrule.\x04""Because of you, it is a FINE\x01""time for a business like this...\x01""heh heh heh...\x04""Oh... I can only hope you make\x01""the world even worse! I'm your\x01""biggest admirer!\x04""The ghosts called Poes are\x01""spirits of concentrated hatred\x01""that appear in the fields and\x04""graveyard. They hate the world,\x01""just like you!\x04""My lord, if you catch a Poe, I\x01""will pay a lot of money for it...\x01""Heh heh hee!\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F6, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh, you brought a Poe today,\x01""my lord!\x04""........\x04""Hmmm...\x04""This is a normal Poe. Here are\x01""your 10 Rupees. Take them.\x04""Heh heh.\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F7, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Oh, you brought a Poe today,\x01""my lord!\x04""Hmmmm!\x04""Very interesting! This is a Big\x01""Poe!\x04""I'll buy it for 50 Rupees.\x04""On top of that, I'll put 100\x01""points on your card.\x04""If you earn 1,000 points, you'll\x01""be a happy man! Heh heh.\x02""" } },
{ 0x70F8, { 0, 0, "\x1A""Wait a minute! WOW!\x04""You have earned 1,000 points!\x04""My lord, you are a genuine\x01""Ghost Hunter! Of course you\x01""are!\x04""Is that what you expected me\x01""to say? Heh heh heh!\x04""Thanks to you, I have extra Big\x01""Poes, so this will be the last\x01""time I can buy a ghost.\x04""You're thinking about what I\x01""promised would happen at 1,000\x01""points. Heh heh.\x04""Don't worry, I didn't forget.\x01""Just take this, my king.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7100, { 0, 0, "What? Have we met before?\x01""...In my nightmares, maybe?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7101, { 0, 0, "Awww... That's so cute! Could\x01""you tell me where you found\x01""it? I mean, please, sir?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7102, { 0, 0, "Yeeeah! Help me! The Gerudo\x01""King is wearing a MASK!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7103, { 0, 0, "Uh... yeah? So what? ...Your\x01""Majesty.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7104, { 0, 0, "I hate foxes! ...And I'm not too\x01""fond of Gerudo kings either.\x01""Please forget I said that.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7105, { 0, 0, "How irritating! ...Sorry! Not\x01""you! The mask!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7106, { 0, 0, "Hey, you look good! Really!\x01""Please don't hurt me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7107, { 0, 0, "\x08""YEEEAH! What's your problem?!\x01""...What's MY problem? You're\x01""my problem!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7108, { 0, 0, "Oooh... is that a Zora? Those\x01""cool eyes are fascinating... and\x01""much nicer than yours.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7109, { 0, 0, "Oh no! You're scary! Don't\x01""come any closer! Mask or no\x01""mask!\x02""" } },
{ 0x710A, { 0, 0, "Wow... how nostalgic! That\x01""reminds me of when I was little.\x01""Before you came.\x02""" } },
{ 0x710B, { 0, 0, "That's kind of funny... it makes\x01""me laugh! Hee hee! ...Is it OK\x01""to laugh at you?\x02""" } },
{ 0x710C, { 0, 0, "\x08""Uh-oh! I'm sorry, mom! Oh... it's\x01""YOU. That's worse! Don't scare\x01""me like that!\x02""" } },
{ 0x710D, { 0, 0, "What a big head you have!\x01""Bigger than the King of\x01""Hyrule's!\x02""" } },
{ 0x710E, { 0, 0, "Oh, don't do that! I'm shy... and\x01""terrified.\x02""" } },
{ 0x710F, { 0, 0, "Is there a mask competition\x01""going on? I'm voting for you!\x01""Everyone's voting for you!\x01""Nobody dares not to!\x09""\x02""" } },
{ 0x7110, { 0, 0, "Oh! A rabbit! Speaking of\x01""rabbits, I saw a strange man\x01""chasing rabbits around... Not as\x04""strange as a Gerudo in a bunny\x01""hood.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7111, { 0, 0, "Oooh, what a pretty lady! A\x01""very tall, very broad lady with\x01""a beard...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7112, { 0, 0, "Well... I can't think of anything\x01""funny to say... Please don't\x01""make me!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7113, { 0, 0, "A mask... When I was little, I\x01""wore masks too... What? You\x01""can't imagine me doing that? I\x04""can't imagine YOU doing it\x01""either!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7114, { 0, 0, "Ohhhh... I see... It's an illusion...\x01""Please let the Gerudo King be\x01""an illusion too...\x02""" } },
{ 0x7115, { 0, 0, "Hey, don't grow up to be like\x01""me... Too late, I guess. You\x01""grew up to be much worse.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7116, { 0, 0, "\x08""AAAAAAAAAAAH! A\x01""GERUDO!!!!\x04""Wha-? A mask? Why are you\x01""wearing a Gerudo mask... over\x01""your Gerudo face?!\x02""" } },
{ 0x7117, { 0, 0, "Sorry, I'm busy right now. Very\x01""busy. Busy forever, if you're\x01""asking.\x02""" } },
{ 0x7118, { 0, 0, "Oh wow! It's Keaton! Hi,\x01""Keaton! ...Why is Keaton so\x01""huge?\x02""" } },
{ 0x7119, { 0, 0, "How spooky! There's a boy in\x01""Kakariko Village who was looking\x01""for a mask like that!\x02""" } },
